WEBVTT

1
00:01:40,843 --> 00:01:42,052
...salut.

2
00:02:45,155 --> 00:02:47,805
<font color="#ffcc00" face="Times New Roman">16 TAHUN SEJAK KEMATIAN MARCUS AURELIUS.</font>

3
00:02:47,829 --> 00:02:51,529
<font color="#ffcc00" face="Times New Roman">"MIMPI ROMA"-NYA TELAH TERLUPAKAN.</font>

4
00:02:51,553 --> 00:02:54,353
<font color="#ffcc00" face="Times New Roman">DI BAWAH KEZALIMAN KEDUA KAISAR,</font>

5
00:02:54,377 --> 00:03:00,177
<font color="#ffcc00" face="Times New Roman">GETA DAN CARACALLA, KORUPSI MAKIN MARAK.</font>

6
00:03:02,202 --> 00:03:06,702
<font color="#ffcc00" face="Times New Roman">AGRESI KEJAM MERAJALELA DI SELURUH KEKAISARAN.</font>

7
00:03:06,726 --> 00:03:09,626
<font color="#ffcc00" face="Times New Roman">KEJATUHAN KOTA BESAR TIDAK TERHINDARKAN.</font>

8
00:03:09,650 --> 00:03:14,150
<font color="#ffcc00" face="Times New Roman">HANYA YANG BERANI BERMIMPI YANG MASIH PUNYA HARAPAN...</font>

9
00:03:56,937 --> 00:03:59,064
Jangan kasari, Hanno.

10
00:05:22,731 --> 00:05:25,484
Dengan nama-nama agungmu,

11
00:05:25,567 --> 00:05:27,319
kami memohon pertolonganmu.

12
00:05:27,402 --> 00:05:29,071
Kalahkan para Romawi.

13
00:05:29,095 --> 00:05:33,460
{\an8}<font face="Times New Roman" color="#ffcc00">NUMIDIA 200 MASEHI</font>

14
00:05:29,154 --> 00:05:30,739
Hancurkan kapal,

15
00:05:30,822 --> 00:05:32,449
mesin perang,

16
00:05:32,533 --> 00:05:34,409
dan pasukan mereka.

17
00:05:34,493 --> 00:05:37,538
Kita pasti menang.

18
00:05:42,459 --> 00:05:44,336
Ozalsce.

19
00:05:46,838 --> 00:05:48,465
Arishat.

20
00:06:02,771 --> 00:06:04,147
Hanno.

21
00:06:07,442 --> 00:06:10,487
Hari ini kau tak bawa persembahan.

22
00:06:10,571 --> 00:06:12,990
Aku lebih suka korbankan orang Romawi.

23
00:06:28,755 --> 00:06:30,215
Dimanapun dirimu,

24
00:06:31,258 --> 00:06:32,342
aku pun ada.

25
00:06:36,221 --> 00:06:37,889
Dan dimanapun dirimu,

26
00:06:37,973 --> 00:06:40,934
aku akan selalu ada.

27
00:06:41,018 --> 00:06:42,519
Istriku.

28
00:07:18,138 --> 00:07:20,807
Angin kencang sekali.
Gulung layar dan gunakan dayung.

29
00:07:20,891 --> 00:07:23,226
Turunkan layar, mulai mendayung!

30
00:07:23,310 --> 00:07:25,312
Turunkan layar dan mulai dayung!

31
00:07:33,612 --> 00:07:35,739
Mulai dayung!

32
00:08:02,974 --> 00:08:05,977
Tanah mereka hanyalah tanah rampasan.

33
00:08:06,061 --> 00:08:08,772
Mereka pergi, membawa kehancuran,

34
00:08:08,855 --> 00:08:10,565
dan katanya membawa damai.

35
00:08:12,401 --> 00:08:15,237
Ini kota bebas terakhir di Afrika Nova.

36
00:08:16,321 --> 00:08:19,449
Hari ini, kita akan perang.

37
00:08:20,742 --> 00:08:25,330
Berdoalah agar Tuhanmu menyertaimu.
Kalau tidak, dia bukan Tuhan.

38
00:08:28,258 --> 00:08:30,469
Tidak perlu takut.

39
00:08:30,552 --> 00:08:32,513
Dimana ada kematian, kita tidak ada.

40
00:08:33,347 --> 00:08:35,132
Di sini,

41
00:08:36,475 --> 00:08:38,368
kematian tidak ada.

42
00:08:40,312 --> 00:08:41,939
Tetap bersama dan dengar perintahku.

43
00:08:45,651 --> 00:08:48,403
Tetap waspada, fokus.

44
00:09:23,647 --> 00:09:25,857
Tembak!

45
00:09:30,612 --> 00:09:34,032
Siapkan senjata!

46
00:09:34,116 --> 00:09:35,325
Lagi!

47
00:09:41,290 --> 00:09:43,250
Kebakaran di kanan!

48
00:09:44,459 --> 00:09:46,336
Pertahankan formasi!

49
00:09:49,965 --> 00:09:51,675
Tarik!

50
00:09:57,973 --> 00:09:59,600
Pemanah siap.

51
00:09:59,683 --> 00:10:01,310
Panah!

52
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:09,526
Pasang busur!

53
00:10:09,610 --> 00:10:11,945
Tarik!

54
00:10:12,029 --> 00:10:13,322
Panah!

55
00:10:20,329 --> 00:10:21,538
Pemanah!

56
00:10:29,588 --> 00:10:31,298
Tembak!

57
00:10:42,726 --> 00:10:45,812
- Naikkan menara!
- Naikkan menara!

58
00:11:01,745 --> 00:11:04,164
- Mundur!
- Mundur!

59
00:11:11,254 --> 00:11:13,173
Putar terus.

60
00:11:23,100 --> 00:11:24,851
Jembatannya macet!

61
00:11:24,935 --> 00:11:26,520
Jembatannya macet!

62
00:11:36,154 --> 00:11:37,614
Pak!

63
00:11:40,033 --> 00:11:41,284
Lepaskan!

64
00:11:52,963 --> 00:11:54,631
Kembali.

65
00:12:57,319 --> 00:12:58,779
Pemanah!

66
00:12:58,862 --> 00:12:59,988
Itu!

67
00:13:00,071 --> 00:13:01,448
Bunuh dia!

68
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,617
Arishat!

69
00:14:13,562 --> 00:14:15,647
Arishat.

70
00:14:26,908 --> 00:14:31,121
Arishat!

71
00:14:38,211 --> 00:14:40,213
Aku akan menunggumu.

72
00:15:23,173 --> 00:15:25,008
Periksa semua mayat!

73
00:15:25,091 --> 00:15:27,010
Jangan sampai tersisa!

74
00:17:14,785 --> 00:17:16,579
Kutaklukkan kota ini...

75
00:17:19,290 --> 00:17:21,292
demi kejayaan Roma.

76
00:17:23,085 --> 00:17:24,879
Sengsara bagi yang kalah.

77
00:17:27,673 --> 00:17:29,383
Sengsara bagi yang kalah.

78
00:17:48,402 --> 00:17:49,487
Berikutnya!

79
00:17:52,239 --> 00:17:53,365
Ayo!

80
00:18:09,048 --> 00:18:12,301
- Turun tangga!
- Ke bawah!

81
00:18:59,390 --> 00:19:02,434
Hei.

82
00:19:02,518 --> 00:19:04,687
Mereka apakan kau sampai terluka?

83
00:19:17,491 --> 00:19:19,535
Angkat.
Pelan-pelan.

84
00:19:19,618 --> 00:19:21,912
Tahan ini.

85
00:19:27,793 --> 00:19:29,211
Arishat?

86
00:19:32,464 --> 00:19:33,924
Aku turut berduka, anakku.

87
00:19:37,386 --> 00:19:39,096
Waktuku tak lama lagi.

88
00:19:40,389 --> 00:19:42,433
Kapal ini...

89
00:19:42,516 --> 00:19:44,894
menuju ke tempat yang tak kuinginkan.

90
00:19:44,977 --> 00:19:48,105
Aku rela dibawa ke tempat lain.

91
00:19:48,189 --> 00:19:50,316
Tetaplah di sini sebentar.

92
00:19:53,652 --> 00:19:58,324
Aku ingat pertama kali kau dibawa kemari.

93
00:19:58,407 --> 00:20:01,493
Bocah kesepian gurun.
Lugu.

94
00:20:01,577 --> 00:20:02,870
Ketakutan.

95
00:20:03,913 --> 00:20:07,124
Kau menerima semua yang kami ajarkan.

96
00:20:09,293 --> 00:20:13,505
Cinta Arishat telah kau temukan.
Jiwamu terlahir kembali.

97
00:20:14,715 --> 00:20:17,968
Jika aku mati,

98
00:20:18,052 --> 00:20:20,971
leluhurku akan menyambutku di kehidupan kelak.

99
00:20:23,015 --> 00:20:24,308
Siapa yang sambut?

100
00:20:24,391 --> 00:20:26,644
Hanno,

101
00:20:26,727 --> 00:20:28,604
aku sudah selesai.

102
00:20:28,687 --> 00:20:32,066
Jangan mau mereka mengubahmu.

103
00:21:03,639 --> 00:21:04,807
Ada lihat anak laki-laki ini?

104
00:21:10,145 --> 00:21:12,439
Eama!

105
00:21:17,736 --> 00:21:20,239
Saatnya kau pergi sendiri, Hanno.

106
00:21:23,826 --> 00:21:25,828
Sembunyilah dari mereka.

107
00:21:30,416 --> 00:21:32,418
Pergi.

108
00:22:02,785 --> 00:22:05,585
{\an8}<font color="#ffcc00" face="Times New Roman">PELABUHAN OSTIA KOTA ROMA</font>

109
00:23:25,364 --> 00:23:28,659
Acacius!

110
00:23:28,742 --> 00:23:30,077
Kaisar Geta.

111
00:23:32,287 --> 00:23:34,039
Kaisar Caracalla.

112
00:23:35,541 --> 00:23:37,167
Jenderal Acacius.

113
00:23:37,251 --> 00:23:40,254
Numidia telah kutaklukkan demi kalian,

114
00:23:40,337 --> 00:23:42,172
agar kekuasaan kalian...

115
00:23:42,256 --> 00:23:44,466
melebihi para kaisar terdahulu.

116
00:23:44,550 --> 00:23:47,094
Mahkotai dia daun laurel, saudara.

117
00:23:55,936 --> 00:23:59,189
Acacius!

118
00:24:04,695 --> 00:24:06,697
Untuk kemenanganmu,

119
00:24:07,573 --> 00:24:09,783
pertandingan akan diadakan di Colosseum.

120
00:24:10,909 --> 00:24:13,495
Aku tak butuh pertandingan demi kehormatanku.

121
00:24:13,579 --> 00:24:17,166
Melayani Senat dan rakyat Roma sudah...

122
00:24:17,249 --> 00:24:18,959
menjadi kehormatan bagiku.

123
00:24:19,042 --> 00:24:21,837
Kau merendah sekali, Acacius.

124
00:24:21,920 --> 00:24:25,132
Itu tak pantas untuk jenderal sehebat dirimu.

125
00:24:27,259 --> 00:24:30,095
Kemuliaan itu milikmu, bukan aku.

126
00:24:30,179 --> 00:24:33,307
Aku cuma ingin beristirahat dari perang,

127
00:24:33,390 --> 00:24:34,892
agar bisa bersama istriku.

128
00:24:34,975 --> 00:24:37,394
Istrimu, ya.

129
00:24:37,478 --> 00:24:39,188
Ingat hak istimewa yang kami berikan padanya?

130
00:24:40,689 --> 00:24:42,816
Ke mana dia sampai tak hadir di saat seperti ini?

131
00:24:42,900 --> 00:24:45,694
Masih ada kemenangan lain menunggu.

132
00:24:47,279 --> 00:24:48,864
Persia.

133
00:24:50,157 --> 00:24:51,116
India.

134
00:24:52,451 --> 00:24:55,996
Keduanya harus ditaklukkan.

135
00:24:57,831 --> 00:25:00,417
Roma memiliki banyak rakyat.

136
00:25:00,501 --> 00:25:02,461
Harus diberi makan.

137
00:25:03,629 --> 00:25:05,964
Mereka bisa makan perang.

138
00:25:08,759 --> 00:25:11,970
Kemenanganmu akan dirayakan...

139
00:25:12,721 --> 00:25:15,224
sebagai lambang keagungan...

140
00:25:15,891 --> 00:25:17,309
rakyat Roma.

141
00:25:23,725 --> 00:25:27,325
{\an8}<font color="#ffcc00" face="Times New Roman">ANTIUM PINGGIRAN KOTA ROMA</font>

142
00:25:39,581 --> 00:25:40,749
Mati saja kau!

143
00:26:00,852 --> 00:26:03,272
Macrinus dari Thysdrus,

144
00:26:03,355 --> 00:26:05,566
penguasa gladiator!

145
00:26:28,088 --> 00:26:29,965
Tetap bersama.

146
00:26:46,315 --> 00:26:50,193
Para Aediles, anggota dewan,

147
00:26:50,819 --> 00:26:53,488
tamu kehormatan,

148
00:26:54,489 --> 00:26:56,450
dan warga Antium,

149
00:27:00,078 --> 00:27:02,539
lihatlah nasib...

150
00:27:03,832 --> 00:27:06,501
musuh Roma yang kalah:

151
00:27:07,753 --> 00:27:12,633
Barbar Numidia dan pemimpinnya,

152
00:27:13,342 --> 00:27:16,261
Jugurtha!

153
00:28:36,508 --> 00:28:37,843
Pria itu menarik.

154
00:29:04,619 --> 00:29:06,079
Kubeli dia.

155
00:29:27,017 --> 00:29:30,353
Berhenti! Siapa?

156
00:29:31,813 --> 00:29:33,148
Jenderal.

157
00:30:08,558 --> 00:30:10,227
Tuan Putri.

158
00:30:18,360 --> 00:30:20,737
Puji para dewa memulangkanmu dengan selamat.

159
00:30:20,821 --> 00:30:23,990
Berterima kasihlah pada pasukan.
Mereka yang melindungiku.

160
00:30:25,659 --> 00:30:26,910


161
00:30:27,069 --> 00:30:28,821
Ayo, makan.

162
00:30:56,432 --> 00:30:57,558
Turun.

163
00:30:58,184 --> 00:30:59,643
Ke tembok.

164
00:31:10,362 --> 00:31:12,740
Arena adalah kuil suci.

165
00:31:12,823 --> 00:31:14,450
Cuma yang berani...

166
00:31:14,533 --> 00:31:17,411
melangkah yang bisa meraih kemuliaan.

167
00:31:17,495 --> 00:31:19,538
Arena mengubah budak menjadi gladiator,

168
00:31:19,622 --> 00:31:21,582
dan gladiator menjadi orang merdeka.

169
00:31:28,798 --> 00:31:30,424
Kau cacingan.

170
00:31:34,303 --> 00:31:37,681
Aku tahu orang ini.
Dia pemakan monyet.

171
00:31:51,862 --> 00:31:54,240
Ayo. Duduk. Makan.

172
00:32:54,800 --> 00:32:55,926
Kau.

173
00:32:57,261 --> 00:32:59,722
Hanno, berdiri.

174
00:33:05,561 --> 00:33:09,773
Apa bahasa aslimu?
Aku kuasai semuanya.

175
00:33:13,277 --> 00:33:16,572
Kau tak jawab karena tak bisa atau tak mau?

176
00:33:18,657 --> 00:33:19,867
Oke.

177
00:33:19,950 --> 00:33:23,746
Kekerasan adalah bahasa yang dipahami semua orang.

178
00:33:23,829 --> 00:33:26,498
Viggo, uji kemampuannya.

179
00:33:26,582 --> 00:33:30,544
Dia bisa lawan kera.
Apa dia bisa lawan manusia.

180
00:34:40,322 --> 00:34:41,532
Cukup!

181
00:34:45,995 --> 00:34:47,246
Bagus.

182
00:34:48,664 --> 00:34:50,124
Bagus sekali.

183
00:34:52,084 --> 00:34:53,544
Bersihkan dia.

184
00:34:57,256 --> 00:34:58,757
Bawa padaku.

185
00:35:05,681 --> 00:35:07,057


186
00:35:09,935 --> 00:35:11,729
Rahang yang kuat.

187
00:35:13,439 --> 00:35:14,898
Lengan bagus.

188
00:35:16,442 --> 00:35:17,735
Tidak bau.

189
00:35:20,779 --> 00:35:22,406
Kau akan berhasil.

190
00:35:23,115 --> 00:35:24,992
Memilih gladiator...

191
00:35:25,075 --> 00:35:26,994
itu seni.

192
00:35:28,370 --> 00:35:30,622
Ada yang memilih penghibur.

193
00:35:30,706 --> 00:35:32,791
Dan memilih kekejaman.

194
00:35:32,875 --> 00:35:34,418
Aku memilih amarah.

195
00:35:38,797 --> 00:35:40,341
Penonton suka darah.

196
00:35:40,424 --> 00:35:42,217
Menyukai orang yang juga sangat menyukai darah.

197
00:35:42,301 --> 00:35:44,803
Kau, temanku, amarahmu...

198
00:35:45,471 --> 00:35:47,765
meluap seperti...

199
00:35:49,141 --> 00:35:50,768
susu... dari tetek pelacur.

200
00:35:51,846 --> 00:35:53,598
Kau akan jadi petarung hebat.

201
00:35:53,682 --> 00:35:55,225
Bukan untukmu.

202
00:35:55,308 --> 00:35:57,394
Benar, kau tidak bertarung untukku.

203
00:35:57,477 --> 00:35:59,854
Aku memasukkanmu ke arena,
kau bertarung atau mati.

204
00:35:59,938 --> 00:36:01,106
Pilihan ada padamu.

205
00:36:01,189 --> 00:36:04,150
Tapi kepala siapa yang bisa...

206
00:36:04,234 --> 00:36:07,862
memuaskan amarahmu ini?

207
00:36:07,946 --> 00:36:09,864
Semua tentara Romawi.

208
00:36:13,368 --> 00:36:14,494
Banyak sekali.

209
00:36:14,578 --> 00:36:16,204


210
00:36:16,288 --> 00:36:18,373
Jenderal akan melakukannya.

211
00:36:18,456 --> 00:36:19,457
Jenderal?

212
00:36:20,792 --> 00:36:22,836
Jenderal Acacius?

213
00:36:25,088 --> 00:36:27,632
Layani aku dengan amarahmu,

214
00:36:27,716 --> 00:36:31,636
dan akan kuserahkan kepalanya untuk pedangmu.

215
00:36:32,804 --> 00:36:35,932
Layani aku, dan kulayani kau.
Tolak,

216
00:36:37,225 --> 00:36:39,769
kau akan mati.

217
00:36:42,731 --> 00:36:46,456
Terkadang kuharap kau meninggalkanku
daripada berperang demi mereka.

218
00:36:46,484 --> 00:36:48,528
Aku sudah memilih.

219
00:36:50,488 --> 00:36:52,449
Aku tak masalah dengan itu.

220
00:36:56,494 --> 00:36:59,497
Tapi kesabaranku untuk dua orang itu sudah habis.

221
00:37:02,250 --> 00:37:04,419
Leta?

222
00:37:04,502 --> 00:37:08,089
Kau boleh ke tempatmu.
Kami tak butuh apa-apa lagi.

223
00:37:15,180 --> 00:37:18,706
Mendengar ratapan istri dan ibu
yang kehilangan di pantai Numidia...

224
00:37:21,144 --> 00:37:22,854
Lucilla.

225
00:37:27,901 --> 00:37:29,444
Cukup.

226
00:37:31,780 --> 00:37:33,865
Tidak akan kubiarkan...

227
00:37:33,948 --> 00:37:37,577
para pemuda jadi korban kesombongan mereka.

228
00:37:39,704 --> 00:37:43,333
Jika aku harus berperang lagi,
itu hanya untuk menggulingkan mereka.

229
00:37:45,168 --> 00:37:47,337
Kapan pasukanmu tiba?

230
00:37:48,088 --> 00:37:50,423
Akan tiba di Ostia 10 hari lagi.

231
00:37:50,507 --> 00:37:54,552
Cuma berapa yang setia padamu?

232
00:37:56,137 --> 00:37:57,597
Semua.

233
00:37:59,599 --> 00:38:03,228
Rakyat tak lagi mendukung kaisar.

234
00:38:03,311 --> 00:38:08,108
Rakyat sudah muak dengan kekacauan dan tirani.

235
00:38:11,069 --> 00:38:15,240
Apa gunanya impian Roma jika rakyatnya terbelenggu?

236
00:38:37,595 --> 00:38:40,098
Nikmatilah, semuanya,

237
00:38:40,181 --> 00:38:42,142
sepuasnya!

238
00:38:42,225 --> 00:38:45,186
Terima kasih.

239
00:38:57,157 --> 00:38:58,491


240
00:38:59,159 --> 00:39:02,245
Silakan, minum.

241
00:39:02,328 --> 00:39:05,248
Maaf. Macrinus!

242
00:39:06,499 --> 00:39:09,169
Aku tahu, provinsi itu tak cukup untukmu.

243
00:39:09,252 --> 00:39:12,422
Aku datang cuma mau nonton pertandingan.

244
00:39:12,505 --> 00:39:14,132
Kau pasti tidak akan kecewa.

245
00:39:14,215 --> 00:39:17,427
Roma punya semua permainan yang disukai pria sepertimu.

246
00:39:17,510 --> 00:39:19,763
Orang sepertiku, Thraex?
Orang seperti kita.

247
00:39:19,846 --> 00:39:23,391
Tidak ada yang bisa terjadi di Roma 
jika belum kau rasakan dulu.

248
00:39:39,949 --> 00:39:41,493
Untuk apa aku di sini?

249
00:39:41,576 --> 00:39:43,077
Kau akan segera tahu.

250
00:39:47,624 --> 00:39:49,793
Apa benar kau mau...

251
00:39:49,876 --> 00:39:53,630
ikut pemilihan Senat, Macrinus?

252
00:39:53,713 --> 00:39:56,216
Aku? Tidak, aku...

253
00:39:56,299 --> 00:39:58,802
Sempoa saja aku tak tahu cara pakainya.

254
00:39:58,885 --> 00:40:00,678
Tapi aku tahu kalau...

255
00:40:01,846 --> 00:40:05,901
tamu-tamumu di sini biasanya taruhan, kan?

256
00:40:05,975 --> 00:40:08,269
Kau mau taruhan berapa?

257
00:40:09,813 --> 00:40:11,314
Seribu dinar emas?

258
00:40:11,397 --> 00:40:12,774
Dua.

259
00:40:14,651 --> 00:40:15,944
Dua?

260
00:40:17,821 --> 00:40:20,156
Dinar.

261
00:40:36,005 --> 00:40:38,800
Mundur!

262
00:40:40,426 --> 00:40:41,845
Kaisar-ku.

263
00:40:41,928 --> 00:40:46,015
Hadirin sekalian, dan para senator.

264
00:40:46,099 --> 00:40:48,476
Agar Anda terhibur,

265
00:40:49,102 --> 00:40:51,437
seni bertarung!

266
00:40:53,565 --> 00:40:55,275
Perkenalkan,

267
00:40:55,358 --> 00:40:57,443
sang barbar melawan,

268
00:40:57,527 --> 00:41:01,698
Vichek, jagoan dari kandangku!

269
00:41:08,913 --> 00:41:11,583
- Ini gladiatormu?
- Ya.

270
00:41:14,961 --> 00:41:17,547
Tiga ronde, pertarungan tangan kosong.

271
00:41:17,630 --> 00:41:19,257
Pedang!

272
00:41:19,340 --> 00:41:22,677
Kami mau pedang.
Pertarungan sampai mati.

273
00:41:23,928 --> 00:41:26,931
Pertarungan tanpa ampun.

274
00:41:27,015 --> 00:41:29,183
Bertarung sekarang!

275
00:41:34,564 --> 00:41:35,773
Saudaraku,

276
00:41:36,816 --> 00:41:38,610
jangan kita saling bunuh hanya demi hiburan mereka.

277
00:42:44,884 --> 00:42:46,552
Hebat!

278
00:42:48,972 --> 00:42:50,598
Hebat!

279
00:42:51,724 --> 00:42:53,810
Thraex, dia pasti gladiator mahal.

280
00:42:55,061 --> 00:42:57,355
- Selamat.
- Makasih.

281
00:42:58,231 --> 00:42:59,691
Hebat.

282
00:43:04,153 --> 00:43:05,780
Asalmu darimana?

283
00:43:11,452 --> 00:43:12,787
Ngomong.

284
00:43:16,374 --> 00:43:17,583
Kubilang ngomong.

285
00:43:17,667 --> 00:43:19,377
Dia dari koloni, Yang Mulia.

286
00:43:19,460 --> 00:43:21,879
Dia cuma mengerti bahasa asalnya.

287
00:43:28,302 --> 00:43:31,389
"Gerbang neraka terbuka siang dan malam.

288
00:43:32,849 --> 00:43:37,979
Turunnya mulus dan jalannya tak sulit.

289
00:43:40,648 --> 00:43:43,067
Tapi...

290
00:43:45,236 --> 00:43:47,196
kembali dari neraka...

291
00:43:47,280 --> 00:43:49,115
untuk melihat langit cerah,

292
00:43:49,198 --> 00:43:53,828
itulah tugas berat yang sesungguhnya."

293
00:44:00,293 --> 00:44:01,711
Virgil, Baginda.

294
00:44:02,754 --> 00:44:03,755
Puisi!

295
00:44:07,133 --> 00:44:09,802
- Pintar sekali, Macrinus.
- Terima kasih.

296
00:44:11,054 --> 00:44:13,389
Tadi aku sudah jenuh,
tapi kau mengejutkanku.

297
00:44:13,473 --> 00:44:16,517
Hanya itu yang kuinginkan, menghiburmu.

298
00:44:16,601 --> 00:44:18,478
Kami terhibur.

299
00:44:20,438 --> 00:44:21,814
Kami terhibur.

300
00:44:23,149 --> 00:44:26,360
Kami tak sabar melihat penyairmu...

301
00:44:27,361 --> 00:44:28,696
tampil di arena.

302
00:44:28,780 --> 00:44:31,783
Aku juga, Baginda.

303
00:44:32,492 --> 00:44:33,618
Terima kasih.

304
00:44:34,160 --> 00:44:35,119
Viggo?

305
00:44:36,454 --> 00:44:37,914
Ikut aku.

306
00:44:55,973 --> 00:44:58,518
Tadi kau bertarung hebat,
tapi juga beruntung.

307
00:45:00,853 --> 00:45:03,314
Bait-bait yang kau lantunkan.

308
00:45:03,397 --> 00:45:05,983
Aku tahu itu bukan pelajaran dari Afrika.

309
00:45:06,859 --> 00:45:09,070
Sebuah puisi yang baik akan dikenal luas.

310
00:45:09,153 --> 00:45:11,114
Siapa yang ajari puisi?

311
00:45:11,197 --> 00:45:13,366
Perwira Romawi yang tertangkap.

312
00:45:13,449 --> 00:45:16,744
Aku ditugaskan mengawasinya,
dan dia suka bercerita...

313
00:45:16,828 --> 00:45:18,746
untuk mengisi waktu.

314
00:45:19,622 --> 00:45:20,873
Bagaimana nasib tahanan itu?

315
00:45:20,957 --> 00:45:22,500
Kami makan dia.

316
00:45:23,793 --> 00:45:24,836
Seperti kebiasaan orang barbar.

317
00:45:24,919 --> 00:45:27,296
Seperti kebiasaan orang barbar.

318
00:45:27,380 --> 00:45:29,382
Tempat lahirmu?

319
00:45:29,465 --> 00:45:31,759
Apa gunanya masa lalu, jika masa depanku...

320
00:45:31,843 --> 00:45:34,095
mati di arena demi dirimu?

321
00:45:40,768 --> 00:45:42,979
Apa gunanya uang Romawi ini.

322
00:45:46,149 --> 00:45:47,775
Seorang gladiator...

323
00:45:48,609 --> 00:45:50,444
bisa membeli kebebasannya.

324
00:45:51,404 --> 00:45:53,322
Kebebasannya.

325
00:45:54,157 --> 00:45:55,908
Impian Roma.

326
00:45:55,992 --> 00:45:58,035
Budak tak memimpikan kebebasan,

327
00:45:58,119 --> 00:46:00,621
tapi mengimpikan memiliki budak lain.

328
00:46:01,414 --> 00:46:02,957
Cicero.

329
00:46:04,083 --> 00:46:06,544
Begitukah didikanmu, Macrinus?

330
00:46:08,171 --> 00:46:10,798
Apa yang harus kau korbankan demi uang Roma?

331
00:46:12,049 --> 00:46:13,593
Kau menjanjikanku kepala.

332
00:46:13,676 --> 00:46:16,554
Buktikan dirimu,
dan kau bisa ambil kepala siapa saja.

333
00:46:40,703 --> 00:46:42,538
Bapa,

334
00:46:42,622 --> 00:46:45,166
lindungi dan tuntun kami.

335
00:46:58,971 --> 00:47:00,431
Senator.

336
00:47:00,973 --> 00:47:02,266
Tuan Putri.

337
00:47:08,231 --> 00:47:11,817
Tuan Putri,
kuharap keadaan lebih baik saat kita bertemu.

338
00:47:12,568 --> 00:47:14,695
Masa depan yang lebih baik akan tiba.

339
00:47:15,905 --> 00:47:18,282
Untuk apa kita di sini?

340
00:47:18,366 --> 00:47:20,326
Untuk merebut kembali kota ini.

341
00:47:22,078 --> 00:47:25,748
Mengembalikan Roma ke tempatnya semestinya.

342
00:47:27,083 --> 00:47:29,043
Sebuah misi yang menarik.

343
00:47:30,211 --> 00:47:32,755
- Kapan?
- Dihari terakhir pertandingan.

344
00:47:33,631 --> 00:47:36,425
Pasukanku menunggu perintahku di Ostia.

345
00:47:36,509 --> 00:47:39,303
5.000 prajurit setiaku...

346
00:47:40,721 --> 00:47:43,099
akan memasuki Roma dan Colosseum,

347
00:47:43,182 --> 00:47:45,101
menangkap para kaisar...

348
00:47:45,184 --> 00:47:47,194
atas kejahatannya terhadap Senat...

349
00:47:47,687 --> 00:47:49,513
dan rakyat.

350
00:47:50,189 --> 00:47:55,194
Ini rencana besar, tapi juga sangat berisiko.

351
00:47:55,278 --> 00:47:58,030
Roma akan kau kuasai untuk diperintah dan...

352
00:47:58,114 --> 00:48:02,785
Marcus Aurelius pernah berjanji
mengembalikan kekuasaan pada Senat,

353
00:48:02,868 --> 00:48:07,206
tapi itu sudah lama sekali.
Banyak yang sudah berubah.

354
00:48:07,290 --> 00:48:11,210
Rakyat sudah lama hidup tanpa...

355
00:48:11,294 --> 00:48:12,670
harapan.

356
00:48:12,753 --> 00:48:16,424
Namun, dengan waktu dan dukungan...

357
00:48:17,250 --> 00:48:20,670
Lucilla, kau putri Marcus Aurelius.

358
00:48:20,754 --> 00:48:22,881
Aku setia padanya.

359
00:48:24,549 --> 00:48:26,593
Begitu juga kau.

360
00:48:28,803 --> 00:48:30,347
Senator Thraex?

361
00:48:32,015 --> 00:48:35,477
Politik selalu mengikuti kekuasaan, Tuan Putri.

362
00:48:36,520 --> 00:48:39,648
Rebut yang menjadi milikmu,

363
00:48:40,565 --> 00:48:42,692
dan Senat akan mendukungmu.

364
00:48:43,693 --> 00:48:44,986
Terima kasih.

365
00:49:01,044 --> 00:49:02,504
Makanan!

366
00:49:07,050 --> 00:49:09,469
Mereka tak pernah bilang soal...

367
00:49:09,553 --> 00:49:11,805
bau busuk di tempat ini.

368
00:49:13,682 --> 00:49:14,891
Itu Hanno.

369
00:49:18,228 --> 00:49:21,064
Kau harus terima aku apa adanya.

370
00:49:26,236 --> 00:49:29,406
Itu apa di atas?
Serigala?

371
00:49:31,074 --> 00:49:34,327
Si kembar itu, mereka dikucilkan.

372
00:49:34,411 --> 00:49:36,162
Dibuang di bukit untuk mati.

373
00:49:37,581 --> 00:49:41,293
Serigala itu menemukannya dan menyusui mereka.

374
00:49:42,502 --> 00:49:44,838
Dibesarkan oleh hewan.
Sudah sifat mereka.

375
00:49:44,921 --> 00:49:47,841
Kok bisa tahu tempat ini?

376
00:49:48,925 --> 00:49:51,011
Aku tahu perbuatan kerusakan mereka.

377
00:49:52,178 --> 00:49:54,973
Kota ini merusak semua yang disentuhnya.

378
00:49:55,056 --> 00:49:57,142
Tak kusangka akan sebesar ini.

379
00:49:57,225 --> 00:49:58,977
Jangan tertipu.

380
00:49:59,060 --> 00:50:01,146
Kota ini berpenyakit.

381
00:50:02,397 --> 00:50:04,608
Makanan!

382
00:50:28,256 --> 00:50:30,800
Kau! Bajingan barbar!

383
00:50:36,640 --> 00:50:38,725
Tolong. Kumohon, tolong!

384
00:51:15,428 --> 00:51:16,763
Thraex.

385
00:51:20,517 --> 00:51:21,559
Soal taruhan kita.

386
00:51:21,643 --> 00:51:23,395
Si barbar.

387
00:51:23,478 --> 00:51:24,813
Ya, aku tak lupa,
utangku selalu kulunasi.

388
00:51:24,896 --> 00:51:26,773
Aku cuma mau sampaikan,

389
00:51:26,856 --> 00:51:28,817
siapa tahu keberuntunganmu berubah.

390
00:51:28,900 --> 00:51:31,361
Mau gandakan atau kita akhiri?

391
00:51:35,824 --> 00:51:36,991


392
00:51:49,295 --> 00:51:50,755
Mundur!

393
00:52:04,936 --> 00:52:06,563
Daging segar.

394
00:52:10,525 --> 00:52:12,485
Antri!

395
00:52:43,016 --> 00:52:45,685
Mainkan!

396
00:53:00,825 --> 00:53:03,203
Kaisar Caracalla.

397
00:53:03,828 --> 00:53:05,747
Kaisar Geta.

398
00:53:05,830 --> 00:53:08,458
Warga Roma!

399
00:53:10,418 --> 00:53:13,463
Pertandingan suci ini...

400
00:53:13,546 --> 00:53:16,800
untuk menghormati kemenangan Roma

401
00:53:16,883 --> 00:53:19,969
melawan para barbar dari Numidia.

402
00:53:21,262 --> 00:53:23,890
Maju!

403
00:53:26,684 --> 00:53:30,188
Dan untuk menghormati panglima legiun Roma,

404
00:53:30,271 --> 00:53:32,482
Jenderal Justus Acacius!

405
00:53:32,565 --> 00:53:35,235
Hidup Acacius!

406
00:53:35,318 --> 00:53:36,778
Dan bersamanya,

407
00:53:36,861 --> 00:53:41,574
Lucilla, putri Kaisar Marcus Aurelius.

408
00:53:43,368 --> 00:53:46,955
- Lucilla!
- Ratu Roma!

409
00:53:47,831 --> 00:53:49,249
Acacius.

410
00:53:49,833 --> 00:53:50,959
Jenderal.

411
00:53:58,550 --> 00:54:01,886
Acacius!

412
00:54:01,970 --> 00:54:07,100
Acacius!

413
00:54:07,976 --> 00:54:09,018
Bicaralah pada mereka.

414
00:54:09,102 --> 00:54:11,604
Bicaralah pada kami!

415
00:54:19,779 --> 00:54:22,574
Aku bukan orator...

416
00:54:22,657 --> 00:54:24,284
atau politsi.

417
00:54:25,493 --> 00:54:27,203
Aku seorang prajurit.

418
00:54:29,581 --> 00:54:34,878
Sudah kulihat keberanian pria dan wanita selama perang.

419
00:54:35,545 --> 00:54:37,422
Pernah juga di arena ini.

420
00:54:38,882 --> 00:54:41,175
Jika kalian meminta sesuatu dari para dewa,

421
00:54:42,510 --> 00:54:44,971
mintalah keberanian itu.

422
00:54:47,181 --> 00:54:49,392
Karena Roma butuh itu sekarang.

423
00:54:53,438 --> 00:54:56,274
Acacius!

424
00:54:56,357 --> 00:54:59,652
Acacius!

425
00:55:12,206 --> 00:55:14,709
Dari Gerbang Selatan,

426
00:55:14,792 --> 00:55:19,923
para petarung dari kandang Macrinus di Thysdrus!

427
00:55:32,393 --> 00:55:34,395
Dari kandang...

428
00:55:34,479 --> 00:55:38,066
Kaisar Caracalla dan Geta,

429
00:55:38,149 --> 00:55:40,735
sang juara tak terkalahkan:

430
00:55:40,818 --> 00:55:44,489
Glyceo Sang Penghancur!

431
00:55:51,079 --> 00:55:52,038
Tahan.

432
00:56:14,894 --> 00:56:16,813
Tahan.

433
00:56:18,022 --> 00:56:19,732
Hidup Kaisar!

434
00:56:21,275 --> 00:56:24,696
Glyceo!

435
00:56:36,332 --> 00:56:39,544
Jaga kekompakan,
dan begitu menyerang, arahkan ke dinding.

436
00:56:39,627 --> 00:56:40,586
Kenapa harus aku?

437
00:56:44,757 --> 00:56:45,717
Tahan!

438
00:56:46,801 --> 00:56:47,927
Tahan!

439
00:56:48,011 --> 00:56:48,970
Serang!

440
00:56:49,971 --> 00:56:51,347
Pengecut!

441
00:57:05,319 --> 00:57:07,488
Ke dinding!

442
00:57:19,417 --> 00:57:20,418
Ayo!

443
00:59:03,729 --> 00:59:06,732
Saudaraku, itu si penyair, kan?

444
00:59:07,441 --> 00:59:09,443
Sudah lupa.

445
00:59:09,527 --> 00:59:11,320
Malam itu tak terlihat jelas.

446
00:59:12,613 --> 00:59:15,283
"Pintu neraka terbuka sepanjang hari.

447
00:59:15,366 --> 00:59:18,452
Turunnya...." aku lupa.

448
00:59:18,536 --> 00:59:20,371
"Turunnya mulus..."

449
00:59:21,122 --> 00:59:23,249
"Turunnya mulus...,

450
00:59:23,708 --> 00:59:25,501
dan jalannya tak sulit."

451
00:59:33,134 --> 00:59:34,218
Perisai!

452
01:00:10,338 --> 01:00:13,925
Ampuni!

453
01:00:15,676 --> 01:00:16,969
Darah.

454
01:00:19,931 --> 01:00:21,140
Lucilla,

455
01:00:21,724 --> 01:00:23,059
kita ampuni?

456
01:00:23,142 --> 01:00:24,852
Ampuni.

457
01:00:40,117 --> 01:00:42,119
Tidak ada ampun!

458
01:00:42,203 --> 01:00:44,080
Hidupmu sudah diselamatkan para dewa...

459
01:00:44,163 --> 01:00:48,292
Lebih baik aku melawanmu daripada diampuni Romawi!

460
01:01:04,308 --> 01:01:07,728
Bunuh!

461
01:01:07,812 --> 01:01:11,065
Bunuh!

462
01:01:22,451 --> 01:01:27,540
Hanno!

463
01:01:52,926 --> 01:01:55,721
Kebebasan bukan dari arena.

464
01:01:56,430 --> 01:01:58,056
Melainkan di sini.

465
01:02:02,477 --> 01:02:04,479
Pergilah ke selmu.

466
01:02:08,275 --> 01:02:11,903
Hanno! Hanno!

467
01:02:28,712 --> 01:02:30,172
Ayo, pergi.

468
01:02:43,310 --> 01:02:46,646
"Pintu neraka terbuka sepanjang hari.

469
01:02:47,564 --> 01:02:49,232
"Jalannya mulus,

470
01:02:49,316 --> 01:02:51,318
turunnya mudah."

471
01:02:55,322 --> 01:02:57,741
Itu.

472
01:02:57,824 --> 01:02:59,159
Kutangkap kau.

473
01:02:59,242 --> 01:03:01,953
Aku Maximus, penyelamat Roma!

474
01:03:21,431 --> 01:03:23,558
Scatto dan Argento.

475
01:03:37,197 --> 01:03:38,657
Lucius aman?

476
01:03:56,383 --> 01:03:57,551
Lucius!

477
01:04:10,146 --> 01:04:12,065
Lucius,

478
01:04:12,148 --> 01:04:15,193
kini hanya kau pewaris tahta.

479
01:04:16,862 --> 01:04:19,896
Ada yang ingin membunuhmu demi kekuasaan.

480
01:04:21,408 --> 01:04:24,661
Ibu janji akan mengembalikanmu begitu aman.

481
01:04:24,744 --> 01:04:28,373
Ibu, kenapa tidak ikut?

482
01:04:28,456 --> 01:04:30,917
Ibu harus tetap di sini demi keselamatanmu.

483
01:04:31,001 --> 01:04:33,003
Dan demi Roma.

484
01:04:33,086 --> 01:04:35,589
Ingat siapa dirimu.

485
01:04:35,672 --> 01:04:37,632
Ibu menyayangimu.

486
01:04:38,258 --> 01:04:39,718
Aku menyayangimu.

487
01:04:40,552 --> 01:04:41,678
Ayo.

488
01:04:44,848 --> 01:04:46,308
Kakimu.

489
01:04:48,059 --> 01:04:49,811
Pergi. Cepat!

490
01:04:56,484 --> 01:04:58,069
Jadi...

491
01:05:01,281 --> 01:05:02,824
Siapa namamu?

492
01:05:05,535 --> 01:05:08,204
Aku Ravi, dokter.

493
01:05:09,331 --> 01:05:12,876
Banyak yang mati karena infeksi luka...

494
01:05:12,959 --> 01:05:15,587
daripada di arena.

495
01:05:16,880 --> 01:05:22,558
Lukanya harus dibersihkan, dijahit,
dan pasti sakit.

496
01:05:22,636 --> 01:05:23,803


497
01:05:23,887 --> 01:05:27,015
Ini Nafas Iblis dan opium.

498
01:05:27,557 --> 01:05:29,184
Untuk mengurangi rasa sakit.

499
01:05:30,060 --> 01:05:31,853
Hirup pelan-pelan.

500
01:05:37,734 --> 01:05:39,277
Aku di sini sudah sangat lama,

501
01:05:39,361 --> 01:05:41,821
sampai aku tak merasa apa-apa lagi.

502
01:05:41,905 --> 01:05:44,741
Sudah banyak yang kuamputasi,
tak terhitung lagi.

503
01:05:45,825 --> 01:05:48,453
- Kau belajar dari mana?
- Kenapa mau tahu?

504
01:05:48,536 --> 01:05:50,288
Tanganmu kuat.

505
01:05:51,581 --> 01:05:53,083
Aku juga gladiator dulu.

506
01:05:53,166 --> 01:05:54,542


507
01:05:54,626 --> 01:05:56,753
Apa kau bisa mengalahkanku?

508
01:05:56,836 --> 01:05:58,421
Di masa jayamu, pasti bisa.

509
01:05:59,506 --> 01:06:02,217
Dalam keadaanmu sekarang,
aku bisa mengalahkanmu.

510
01:06:03,969 --> 01:06:07,222
Kau beruntung,
aku sudah pensiun dengan pedang.

511
01:06:07,305 --> 01:06:09,516
Kini aku lebih memilih...

512
01:06:09,599 --> 01:06:12,185
menyelamatkan nyawa daripada membunuh.

513
01:06:13,687 --> 01:06:16,272
Kenapa baru berubah sekarang?

514
01:06:17,065 --> 01:06:19,275
Perbuatan kita di dunia ini...

515
01:06:19,359 --> 01:06:21,820
akan dikenang selamanya.

516
01:06:25,448 --> 01:06:27,117
Aku pernah dengar kata-kata itu.

517
01:06:27,200 --> 01:06:29,744
Bukan aku penemunya.

518
01:06:29,828 --> 01:06:32,414
Itu tertulis di makam seseorang.

519
01:06:32,497 --> 01:06:35,166
Di atas makam seorang gladiator.

520
01:06:35,250 --> 01:06:36,584
Juaraku!

521
01:06:36,668 --> 01:06:38,878
Aku mencium Nafas Iblis!

522
01:06:41,297 --> 01:06:44,759
Juara...ku.

523
01:06:45,635 --> 01:06:47,470
Dengar sorakan itu?

524
01:06:50,390 --> 01:06:52,684
Dengar sorakan itu?

525
01:06:54,102 --> 01:06:56,730
Ada kekuatan dalam dirimu.
Aku sudah tahu itu.

526
01:06:56,813 --> 01:07:00,775
- Oh, begitu?
- Ya. Orang Yunani menyebutnya...

527
01:07:01,484 --> 01:07:03,028
thymos.

528
01:07:03,111 --> 01:07:04,529
Asap.

529
01:07:05,155 --> 01:07:06,614
Amarah.

530
01:07:07,490 --> 01:07:09,659
Amarah itu karuniamu.

531
01:07:10,243 --> 01:07:13,079
Seperti Achilles yang legendaris.

532
01:07:13,163 --> 01:07:15,498
Jangan biarkan itu hilang.

533
01:07:15,582 --> 01:07:18,460
Itulah jalan menuju kejayaanmu,

534
01:07:18,543 --> 01:07:20,420
juaraku.

535
01:07:39,773 --> 01:07:41,858
Terima kasih...

536
01:07:41,941 --> 01:07:43,902
atas undangannya.

537
01:07:43,985 --> 01:07:46,071
Aku merasa sangat terhormat.

538
01:07:50,034 --> 01:07:52,894
Katanya kau sedang jadi perbincangan di istana.

539
01:07:54,288 --> 01:07:55,414
Ya.

540
01:07:56,207 --> 01:07:57,750
Kita pernah bertemu.

541
01:07:58,375 --> 01:08:00,503
- Kapan?
- Sudah lama.

542
01:08:01,879 --> 01:08:03,464
Di mana?

543
01:08:03,547 --> 01:08:05,466
Dulu aku melayani pasukan ayahmu...

544
01:08:05,549 --> 01:08:07,676
dalam penaklukan di Afrika.

545
01:08:08,803 --> 01:08:10,930
Kau melayani ayahku?

546
01:08:14,558 --> 01:08:15,768


547
01:08:16,352 --> 01:08:18,479
Aku merasa terhormat bisa...

548
01:08:19,396 --> 01:08:21,023
membaca "Meditasi"-nya.

549
01:08:21,107 --> 01:08:22,441


550
01:08:25,319 --> 01:08:27,363
"Balas dendam terbaik...

551
01:08:28,405 --> 01:08:32,042
tidak menjadi seperti orang yang menyakitimu."

552
01:08:33,911 --> 01:08:36,497
Katanya kau sudah persenjatai setengah legiun...

553
01:08:36,580 --> 01:08:41,710
di kekaisaran, dan sekarang di Roma,

554
01:08:42,920 --> 01:08:45,881
pengaruhmu berkembang lewat gladiator.

555
01:08:45,965 --> 01:08:48,050
Semua ini demi cinta pada olahraga itu.

556
01:08:48,134 --> 01:08:51,220
Gladiator itu kau temukan dimana?

557
01:08:52,096 --> 01:08:54,974
Biasanya mereka tahanan perang.

558
01:08:55,808 --> 01:08:59,311
Atau gelandangan. Kenapa tanyakan?

559
01:08:59,395 --> 01:09:02,231
Orang bisa memilih bertarung...

560
01:09:04,024 --> 01:09:05,693
dan hidup.

561
01:09:05,776 --> 01:09:08,988
Hidup dan arena tak jauh beda, kan?

562
01:09:11,365 --> 01:09:13,033
Siapa ini?

563
01:09:13,117 --> 01:09:15,578
Itu ayahku waktu muda.

564
01:09:18,664 --> 01:09:19,957
Punya anak?

565
01:09:20,040 --> 01:09:21,792


566
01:09:21,876 --> 01:09:24,295
Semua orang tahu.
Saat Commodus dibunuh,

567
01:09:24,378 --> 01:09:26,172
anak itu menghilang.

568
01:09:26,255 --> 01:09:28,340
- Lalu siapa yang peduli?
- Lucilla peduli.

569
01:09:28,424 --> 01:09:31,177
- Tambah anggur!
- Tambah anggur!

570
01:09:32,428 --> 01:09:36,015
Dia memang keturunan kerajaan.

571
01:09:37,641 --> 01:09:38,976
Dan ayahnya?

572
01:09:39,059 --> 01:09:43,814
Menurut cerita, Lucius Verus.

573
01:09:43,898 --> 01:09:45,691
Memang, dulunya di jodohkan.

574
01:09:45,774 --> 01:09:46,859
Dia baru 14 tahun.

575
01:09:46,942 --> 01:09:50,321
Wanita bukanlah selera Commodus.

576
01:09:50,404 --> 01:09:51,780
- Kadang aku juga begitu.
- Bukan seleramu juga!

577
01:09:53,407 --> 01:09:57,661
Tidak.
Katanya, pacar dia banyak.

578
01:09:57,745 --> 01:10:01,999
Dan katanya, ayah yang sebenarnya itu Commodus.

579
01:10:02,875 --> 01:10:05,336
- Cinta persaudaraan.
- Ya.

580
01:10:05,419 --> 01:10:07,171
Jika dia mati,

581
01:10:08,088 --> 01:10:10,549
pasti ada mayatnya.

582
01:10:10,633 --> 01:10:13,969
Andai dia hidup, usianya kira-kira...

583
01:10:14,053 --> 01:10:16,138
Ayo kita perkirakan.

584
01:10:16,222 --> 01:10:19,642
- Umurnya kira-kira 12 tahun saat mati?
- Ya.

585
01:10:19,725 --> 01:10:24,104
Berarti dia...

586
01:10:59,640 --> 01:11:00,599
Tuan Putri.

587
01:11:01,141 --> 01:11:02,101
Gracchus.

588
01:11:03,143 --> 01:11:05,104
- Silakan masuk.
- Makasih.

589
01:11:23,831 --> 01:11:25,291
Gladiator,

590
01:11:26,709 --> 01:11:27,793
kau mengenalku?

591
01:11:36,135 --> 01:11:37,553
Punya keluarga?

592
01:11:39,972 --> 01:11:43,309
Istri. Arishat.

593
01:11:44,768 --> 01:11:46,186
Arishat.

594
01:11:46,270 --> 01:11:49,606
Dia dibunuh atas perintah suamimu.

595
01:11:52,234 --> 01:11:54,403
Roma tenggelam dalam darahnya sendiri.

596
01:11:54,486 --> 01:11:56,905
Kau masih menikmati hiburan di Colosseum.

597
01:11:58,115 --> 01:12:01,076
Masih banyak yang belum kau pahami.

598
01:12:07,791 --> 01:12:08,917
Lucius.

599
01:12:09,001 --> 01:12:11,086
Aku tak tahu siapa yang kau maksud.

600
01:12:13,422 --> 01:12:15,299
Namaku Hanno,

601
01:12:15,382 --> 01:12:17,926
dan aku tak punya ibu,
atau tak ada yang kuingat.

602
01:12:24,558 --> 01:12:26,560
Aku sungguh minta maaf.

603
01:12:26,643 --> 01:12:28,771
Jika anakmu di sini, dia tak ingin kau...

604
01:12:28,854 --> 01:12:30,773
bersedih karenanya.

605
01:12:30,856 --> 01:12:32,608
Karena dia bukan lagi anak yang kau suruh pergi.

606
01:12:32,691 --> 01:12:34,777
Anak itu sudah mati.

607
01:12:37,071 --> 01:12:39,281
Mungkin kau anggap aku tak berguna.

608
01:12:40,824 --> 01:12:42,951
Mengira aku sudah mengkhianatimu.

609
01:12:44,828 --> 01:12:46,705
Tapi ketahuilah...

610
01:12:48,040 --> 01:12:51,001
jika kau tak dapat kasih sayang ibumu,

611
01:12:51,085 --> 01:12:54,046
maka ambillah kekuatan ayahmu.

612
01:12:55,172 --> 01:12:56,632
Kau butuh itu.

613
01:12:58,842 --> 01:13:03,138
Namanya Maximus Decimus Meridius.

614
01:13:04,431 --> 01:13:05,933
Dia ada dalam dirimu.

615
01:13:06,016 --> 01:13:07,476
Keluar.

616
01:13:09,478 --> 01:13:12,064
Tuan putri, kita harus pergi!

617
01:13:15,442 --> 01:13:17,861
Lucius, aku dan...

618
01:13:17,945 --> 01:13:21,115
ayahmu sangat mencintaimu.

619
01:13:22,282 --> 01:13:23,784
Dia selalu sebut namamu...

620
01:13:23,867 --> 01:13:25,744
Keluar!

621
01:13:51,687 --> 01:13:53,689
Lucius masih hidup.

622
01:13:55,941 --> 01:13:57,776
Kau yakin?

623
01:13:57,860 --> 01:13:59,236
Ya.

624
01:14:00,112 --> 01:14:01,530
Aku mengenal anakku.

625
01:14:04,491 --> 01:14:06,452
Tadi aku bicara dengannya.

626
01:14:09,746 --> 01:14:12,916
Mungkin dia hilang karenaku,

627
01:14:14,084 --> 01:14:15,836
tapi dia masih hidup.

628
01:14:16,962 --> 01:14:19,590
Hari ketiga pertandingan besok.

629
01:14:19,673 --> 01:14:21,258
Kebanyakan petarung akan tewas.

630
01:14:21,341 --> 01:14:22,801
Acacius,

631
01:14:24,094 --> 01:14:25,679
tolong dia.

632
01:14:26,430 --> 01:14:28,390
- Menolongnya?
- Ya.

633
01:14:30,809 --> 01:14:33,395
Dulu aku tak bisa menolongnya.

634
01:14:33,854 --> 01:14:35,481
Aku tahu itu.

635
01:14:37,191 --> 01:14:39,401
Sekarang aku tak boleh gagal lagi.

636
01:14:41,945 --> 01:14:43,405
Tentara ada di Ostia.

637
01:14:43,489 --> 01:14:46,283
Jika kita tunggu beberapa hari...

638
01:14:46,366 --> 01:14:48,494
Dia bisa mati sebelum itu.

639
01:14:50,454 --> 01:14:51,788
Acacius,

640
01:14:51,872 --> 01:14:55,584
aku rela mati demi Roma,

641
01:14:56,668 --> 01:14:59,171
tapi aku tak mau korbankan anakku.

642
01:15:05,302 --> 01:15:07,638
Dan satu...

643
01:15:08,388 --> 01:15:10,182
Dua...

644
01:15:10,265 --> 01:15:12,976
Satu...

645
01:15:13,060 --> 01:15:16,021
Serempak. Perhatikan waktunya!

646
01:15:17,231 --> 01:15:20,359
Satu... dua...

647
01:15:20,943 --> 01:15:22,903
Dan satu.

648
01:15:22,986 --> 01:15:24,988
Berhenti, berhenti!

649
01:15:27,741 --> 01:15:29,034
Kita takkan bisa jauh jika begini.

650
01:15:30,702 --> 01:15:33,121
Dia saja.
Kalian pergi.

651
01:15:33,205 --> 01:15:34,915
Pergi!

652
01:15:34,998 --> 01:15:38,585
Kita lihat seberapa jauh kemampuanmu tanpa tim.

653
01:15:40,212 --> 01:15:41,713
Siap?

654
01:15:41,797 --> 01:15:43,131
Satu!

655
01:15:43,924 --> 01:15:44,883
Dan dua!

656
01:15:44,967 --> 01:15:47,135
Waktu, waktu!

657
01:15:47,761 --> 01:15:49,221
Ayo, lagi!

658
01:15:54,434 --> 01:15:56,061
Lagi!

659
01:16:12,869 --> 01:16:14,079
Tinggalkan dia.

660
01:16:32,973 --> 01:16:36,476
Hanya cuka, temanku.

661
01:16:38,395 --> 01:16:40,981
Opiumnya sudah habis untukmu.

662
01:16:42,232 --> 01:16:45,902
Banyak penderitaan yang menantimu
di kehidupan nanti.

663
01:16:45,986 --> 01:16:49,448
Entah kenapa kau begitu mendambakan itu di dunia ini.

664
01:16:54,077 --> 01:16:55,537
Kau sudah bebas, Ravi?

665
01:16:55,621 --> 01:16:57,539
"Bebas."

666
01:16:59,166 --> 01:17:01,585
Aku bebas.

667
01:17:01,668 --> 01:17:03,211
Pedangku sudah kutinggalkan...

668
01:17:03,295 --> 01:17:05,297
dan bersumpah tak menyentuhnya lagi.

669
01:17:05,380 --> 01:17:06,965
Tapi kau justru memilih terjebak di sini?

670
01:17:07,049 --> 01:17:08,675


671
01:17:08,759 --> 01:17:10,177
Dulu rumahmu di mana?

672
01:17:11,345 --> 01:17:12,763
Varanasi.

673
01:17:12,846 --> 01:17:15,140
Kenapa tak kembali?

674
01:17:15,223 --> 01:17:16,683
Pengennya.

675
01:17:16,767 --> 01:17:18,560
Tapi...

676
01:17:21,021 --> 01:17:23,148
Aku bertemu seorang wanita.

677
01:17:23,940 --> 01:17:26,360
- Selalu karena wanita.
- Selalu.

678
01:17:26,443 --> 01:17:30,405
Dia dari Londinium. Britannia.

679
01:17:30,489 --> 01:17:32,324
Sekarang...

680
01:17:32,407 --> 01:17:35,369
anak-anak kami hanya tahu bahasa Latin.

681
01:17:35,452 --> 01:17:37,871
Mata putriku, biru seperti matamu.

682
01:17:40,582 --> 01:17:42,167
Kami orang Roma sekarang.

683
01:17:42,250 --> 01:17:46,004
Aku sering mendengarkan cerita kakek waktu kecil.

684
01:17:47,089 --> 01:17:50,509
Dulu dia sering bercerita tentang impian Roma.

685
01:17:52,719 --> 01:17:56,765
Impian itu begitu rapuh, hanya bisa dibisikkan...

686
01:17:58,975 --> 01:18:00,852
agar tidak hilang.

687
01:18:01,645 --> 01:18:03,146
Jadi,

688
01:18:03,230 --> 01:18:04,898
apa impian itu?

689
01:18:04,981 --> 01:18:09,611
Roma tempat semua bisa hidup
di bawah hukum yang adil dan terlindungi.

690
01:18:10,487 --> 01:18:12,447
Roma dari Senat.

691
01:18:13,990 --> 01:18:15,617
Roma penuh harapan.

692
01:18:18,620 --> 01:18:22,999
Sepertinya kakekmu orang yang berbahaya.

693
01:18:23,083 --> 01:18:24,376


694
01:18:27,003 --> 01:18:29,256
Kesempatanmu sangat kecil.

695
01:18:31,508 --> 01:18:33,635
Kesempatanku selalu sangat kecil.

696
01:18:34,511 --> 01:18:35,721
Tenang saja, pak tua.

697
01:18:35,804 --> 01:18:37,639


698
01:18:41,101 --> 01:18:43,353
Kau sebaiknya istirahat.

699
01:18:44,354 --> 01:18:46,898
Besok anak buahmu membutuhkanmu memimpin.

700
01:19:03,123 --> 01:19:04,958
Ini soal bertahan hidup.

701
01:19:05,959 --> 01:19:07,335
Bertahan hidup!

702
01:19:07,419 --> 01:19:11,214
Atas nama Poseidon,

703
01:19:11,298 --> 01:19:15,469
kita rayakan kejayaan peperangan laut.

704
01:19:15,552 --> 01:19:17,304
Mereka punya pemanah.

705
01:19:17,387 --> 01:19:19,848
Bersiaplah.
Dengar perintahku.

706
01:19:19,931 --> 01:19:22,684
Bersama, tarik serentak, ya?

707
01:19:22,768 --> 01:19:23,643
Ya!

708
01:19:23,727 --> 01:19:26,146
- Ya?
- Ya!

709
01:19:32,903 --> 01:19:35,655
Hari ini kita kenang kembali...

710
01:19:35,739 --> 01:19:39,284
Pertempuran Salamis!

711
01:19:40,535 --> 01:19:45,207
Trojan melawan Persia!

712
01:19:49,669 --> 01:19:51,338
- Keluarkan dayung!
- Dayung!

713
01:19:52,005 --> 01:19:54,132
Dan... tarik!

714
01:20:13,735 --> 01:20:15,779
Pemanah!

715
01:20:15,862 --> 01:20:16,863
Pemanah!

716
01:20:18,907 --> 01:20:20,033
Tarik!

717
01:20:28,834 --> 01:20:30,585
Tarik!

718
01:20:33,338 --> 01:20:34,422
Tarik!

719
01:20:47,602 --> 01:20:50,063
Tarik! Sesuai waktuku!

720
01:20:50,730 --> 01:20:52,107
Dan... sekarang!

721
01:20:54,651 --> 01:20:57,028
Sebeleh kiri! Siap, dan...

722
01:20:57,112 --> 01:20:59,072
dayung sekarang!

723
01:20:59,155 --> 01:21:01,324
Masukkan dayung!

724
01:21:02,742 --> 01:21:03,702
Tunduk!

725
01:21:19,801 --> 01:21:23,763
Tarik! Tarik!

726
01:21:26,516 --> 01:21:28,727
Jangan berhenti!

727
01:21:30,979 --> 01:21:32,230
Tarik!

728
01:21:34,816 --> 01:21:36,318
Ke kanan!

729
01:21:41,865 --> 01:21:43,325
Siap menabrak!

730
01:21:45,535 --> 01:21:48,079
Dan bersiaplah!

731
01:22:28,078 --> 01:22:29,579
Semuanya kumpul!

732
01:23:05,782 --> 01:23:07,867
Praetorian!

733
01:23:09,119 --> 01:23:11,621
Hanno!

734
01:23:11,705 --> 01:23:12,664
Ayo, cepat.

735
01:23:19,546 --> 01:23:22,757
Atas nama para kaisar,

736
01:23:22,841 --> 01:23:27,512
pemenangnya adalah Hanno!

737
01:23:39,107 --> 01:23:41,109
Siapa pelakunya?

738
01:23:43,778 --> 01:23:46,072
Siapa?!

739
01:23:46,656 --> 01:23:48,867
- Aku!
- Aku pelakunya!

740
01:23:48,950 --> 01:23:50,910
- Aku pelakunya!
- Itu aku!

741
01:23:54,373 --> 01:23:56,584
Geta akan membalas perbuatan kalian.

742
01:23:57,543 --> 01:23:58,794
Tempatmu belajar memanah juga tempatmu...

743
01:23:58,878 --> 01:24:00,379
belajar berpuisi?

744
01:24:00,463 --> 01:24:01,630
Kalau itu aku,

745
01:24:01,714 --> 01:24:03,090
panah itu pasti sudah menembusmu.

746
01:24:18,898 --> 01:24:20,441
Duduklah.

747
01:24:22,860 --> 01:24:24,361
Ada kabar.

748
01:24:28,783 --> 01:24:30,326
Dia datang, Pak.

749
01:24:33,370 --> 01:24:35,456
Oh, masih di sini.

750
01:24:37,541 --> 01:24:38,959
Macrinus.

751
01:24:39,043 --> 01:24:41,253
Selamat datang.

752
01:24:42,713 --> 01:24:45,049
Ya, aku dengar.

753
01:24:45,132 --> 01:24:47,718
Kau tahu ini rumahku sekarang.

754
01:24:47,802 --> 01:24:50,137
Utangmu sudah lebih 10.000 dinar.

755
01:24:50,221 --> 01:24:51,597
Kau tahu.

756
01:24:51,680 --> 01:24:54,308
Masih ada kukerjakan.

757
01:24:54,391 --> 01:24:56,185
Ternak. Seni!

758
01:24:56,268 --> 01:24:57,895
Jadi, katakan sebenarnya.

759
01:24:57,978 --> 01:24:59,563
Apa maumu?

760
01:24:59,647 --> 01:25:02,316
Sebenarnya. Itu yang kumau.

761
01:25:02,399 --> 01:25:06,946
Di Roma, tak ada yang tidak kau ketahui.

762
01:25:07,988 --> 01:25:10,116
Para senator mempercayaimu.

763
01:25:10,866 --> 01:25:13,077
Lucilla mempercayaimu.

764
01:25:13,160 --> 01:25:15,955
Dan yang terpenting, kepercayaanku.

765
01:25:17,915 --> 01:25:21,877
Kau ingin aku setia?

766
01:25:21,961 --> 01:25:23,712
Rumahmu...

767
01:25:25,047 --> 01:25:26,924
milikku.

768
01:25:27,007 --> 01:25:29,718
Aku ingin kesetiaanmu.

769
01:25:33,389 --> 01:25:34,890
Aku..

770
01:25:36,016 --> 01:25:37,810
- Katakan.
- Aku tahu...

771
01:25:37,893 --> 01:25:40,646
ada rencana...

772
01:25:41,438 --> 01:25:44,150
- untuk menggulingkan para kaisar.
- Ya.

773
01:25:44,233 --> 01:25:46,694
Tapi rencana itu tertunda...

774
01:25:46,777 --> 01:25:49,947
Gladiator itu akan diselamatkan dari arena.

775
01:25:50,030 --> 01:25:51,448
Malam ini.

776
01:25:51,532 --> 01:25:54,743
- Aku tak tahu kenapa.
- Aku tahu kenapa. Aku tahu siapa.

777
01:25:57,037 --> 01:25:58,205
Berkemaslah.

778
01:26:01,750 --> 01:26:03,377
Cepat.

779
01:26:31,155 --> 01:26:32,364
Buka!

780
01:26:52,426 --> 01:26:54,470
Buka untuk pengawal kaisar!

781
01:27:21,956 --> 01:27:25,501
Tuan putri, ikut kami.

782
01:28:10,754 --> 01:28:13,007
Berkat kebaikan warga...

783
01:28:13,090 --> 01:28:15,801
seperti Thraex dan Macrinus,

784
01:28:17,011 --> 01:28:18,804
pemberontakanmu...

785
01:28:19,430 --> 01:28:21,473
akhirnya terbongkar.

786
01:28:23,267 --> 01:28:24,685
Kehormatan,

787
01:28:25,686 --> 01:28:29,648
dan kepercayaan Roma padamu....

788
01:28:32,026 --> 01:28:35,112
telah hilang karena pengkhianatanmu.

789
01:28:35,195 --> 01:28:37,239
Kumohon, Kaisar Geta,

790
01:28:37,823 --> 01:28:39,783
siksa aku jika mau,

791
01:28:40,617 --> 01:28:41,994
tapi jangan mengajariku.

792
01:28:42,077 --> 01:28:45,622
Namamu akan terlupakan!

793
01:28:46,623 --> 01:28:49,752
Terhapus dari sejarah.

794
01:28:51,628 --> 01:28:53,047
Kau terkutuk, Jenderal.

795
01:28:55,758 --> 01:28:57,801
- Ketawa.
- Mengutukku?

796
01:28:58,844 --> 01:29:00,554
Aku tak peduli.

797
01:29:00,637 --> 01:29:04,183
Semua akan terlupakan seiring waktu.
Kekaisaran runtuh. Para kaisar juga.

798
01:29:04,266 --> 01:29:05,976
Tunggu apa lagi?

799
01:29:06,060 --> 01:29:09,271
- Akan kubunuh dia sekarang!
- Tidak, jangan!

800
01:29:09,355 --> 01:29:12,649
Abaikan saja. Ayo!

801
01:29:12,733 --> 01:29:14,568
Dia harus mati di hadapan orang banyak.

802
01:29:14,651 --> 01:29:16,153
Orang banyak?

803
01:29:16,236 --> 01:29:19,114
Gantung isi perutnya di gerbang kota!

804
01:29:19,198 --> 01:29:20,866
Dan salibkan dia!

805
01:29:21,492 --> 01:29:22,993
Salibkan dia!

806
01:29:23,077 --> 01:29:24,995
Bawa mereka!

807
01:29:25,079 --> 01:29:28,540


808
01:29:41,595 --> 01:29:42,846
Terima kasih, Macrinus.

809
01:29:49,103 --> 01:29:50,521
Ayo.

810
01:29:53,857 --> 01:29:55,734
Di akhir-akhir ini,

811
01:29:55,818 --> 01:29:59,071
aku menganggapmu bukan lagi sebagai bawahan,

812
01:29:59,154 --> 01:30:01,365
tapi sebagai teman sejati.

813
01:30:01,448 --> 01:30:03,117
Terima kasih.

814
01:30:03,200 --> 01:30:05,869
Terima kasih banyak. Tapi sebagai teman,

815
01:30:05,953 --> 01:30:08,705
aku rasa kita perlu lebih hati-hati.

816
01:30:08,789 --> 01:30:11,875
Acacius adalah pahlawan Roma.

817
01:30:12,626 --> 01:30:16,130
Hanya pencuri yang pantas disalibkan.

818
01:30:16,213 --> 01:30:17,423
Kristen.

819
01:30:18,465 --> 01:30:21,468
- Itu sering terjadi.
- Dia pengkhianat. Dia harus mati.

820
01:30:21,552 --> 01:30:22,928
Aku setuju.

821
01:30:23,011 --> 01:30:28,851
Serahkan takdirnya pada para dewa di Colosseum.

822
01:30:35,149 --> 01:30:36,859
Serahkan pada dewa.

823
01:30:39,570 --> 01:30:43,699
Semalam aku terbangun,
bermimpi tentang sungai yang hitam.

824
01:30:45,159 --> 01:30:47,119
Dan baru kali ini...

825
01:30:47,202 --> 01:30:48,787
aku menyeberanginya.

826
01:30:49,496 --> 01:30:51,165


827
01:30:51,248 --> 01:30:53,750
Di kampung halamanku,

828
01:30:53,834 --> 01:30:56,837
menyeberangi sungai berarti pengampunan.

829
01:30:56,920 --> 01:30:59,923
Dan keselamatan.

830
01:31:00,007 --> 01:31:03,093
Di kampung halamanku, artinya kau sudah mati.

831
01:31:11,351 --> 01:31:13,979
Tapi saat kulihat, aku tak takut.

832
01:31:15,606 --> 01:31:17,274
Sebab...

833
01:31:17,357 --> 01:31:20,319
ada yang menungguku di seberang.

834
01:31:21,862 --> 01:31:23,697
Sudah.

835
01:31:33,874 --> 01:31:35,501
Siapa para pria ini?

836
01:31:36,752 --> 01:31:38,295
Namanya dihapus?

837
01:31:39,129 --> 01:31:41,256
Maximus.

838
01:31:43,926 --> 01:31:46,011
Aku pernah melihatnya bertarung.

839
01:31:46,970 --> 01:31:48,555
Dia hebat sekali.

840
01:31:48,639 --> 01:31:51,600
Masaku di arena setelah masanya,

841
01:31:51,683 --> 01:31:55,979
tapi banyak yang masih berbisik tentang dirinya.

842
01:31:56,063 --> 01:31:58,357
Dibicarakan orang.

843
01:31:59,066 --> 01:32:00,776
Tentang perbuatannya.

844
01:32:00,859 --> 01:32:02,861
Aku pernah bertemu dengannya.

845
01:32:04,571 --> 01:32:06,198
Dia baik.

846
01:32:08,408 --> 01:32:10,369
Dia tak pernah tunduk pada siapa pun.

847
01:32:13,747 --> 01:32:15,415
Ikut aku.

848
01:32:15,499 --> 01:32:18,627
Ayo, ikut.

849
01:32:37,604 --> 01:32:41,817
Saat seorang gladiator pemberontak mati,
dkubur di sini.

850
01:32:41,900 --> 01:32:46,405
"Perbuatan kita akan dikenang selamanya."

851
01:33:04,006 --> 01:33:05,882
Ini Argento.

852
01:33:05,966 --> 01:33:07,593
Ini Scatto.

853
01:33:47,883 --> 01:33:49,635
Bersulang.

854
01:33:50,218 --> 01:33:51,720
Berhenti.

855
01:33:53,263 --> 01:33:57,351
Karena pengkhianatannya terhadap...

856
01:33:57,434 --> 01:34:01,521
kaisar dan negara Romawi,

857
01:34:01,605 --> 01:34:05,067
Jenderal Justus Acacius,

858
01:34:06,360 --> 01:34:09,363
musuh rakyat!

859
01:34:09,446 --> 01:34:11,948
Acacius!

860
01:34:12,032 --> 01:34:14,493
- Kami mencintaimu, Acacius!
- Kau pahlawan!

861
01:34:15,702 --> 01:34:18,789
Acacius!

862
01:34:50,195 --> 01:34:52,906
- Celaka bagi yang kalah.
- Jenderal.

863
01:35:14,928 --> 01:35:16,972
Acacius!

864
01:35:18,098 --> 01:35:22,310
Acacius!

865
01:35:28,275 --> 01:35:32,404
Dari kota Numidia yang ditaklukkan,

866
01:35:33,488 --> 01:35:38,744
sang pemenang dua duel di Colosseum...

867
01:35:38,827 --> 01:35:41,455
Pergilah.
Celaka bagi yang kalah.

868
01:35:45,667 --> 01:35:48,545
Hanno!

869
01:35:48,628 --> 01:35:50,964
Tidak!

870
01:35:51,047 --> 01:35:53,842
Tuan, segala kehormatanku,

871
01:35:53,925 --> 01:35:55,635
- akan kuberikan padamu!
- Sudah terlambat.

872
01:35:55,719 --> 01:35:59,014
Pengkhianat Romawi atau...

873
01:35:59,097 --> 01:36:01,475
sang pahlawan barbar.

874
01:36:02,142 --> 01:36:03,935
Biarkan para dewa yang putuskan.

875
01:36:04,019 --> 01:36:05,812
Lucius... tunggu.

876
01:36:07,189 --> 01:36:08,440
Tunggu!

877
01:36:18,408 --> 01:36:21,244
Aku adalah wadah.

878
01:36:22,496 --> 01:36:24,831
Isi aku amarah...

879
01:36:25,707 --> 01:36:28,043
dan kalahkan pengkhianat itu.

880
01:36:45,769 --> 01:36:48,146
- Kami mencintaimu, Acacius!
- Cepat!

881
01:36:52,150 --> 01:36:53,819
Ambil itu!

882
01:36:53,902 --> 01:36:56,279
Bravo, Hanno!

883
01:36:56,363 --> 01:36:57,823
Kami mencintaimu, Acacius!

884
01:36:57,906 --> 01:36:58,907
Tunggu apa lagi?

885
01:36:58,990 --> 01:37:00,033
Kau akan mati!

886
01:37:31,022 --> 01:37:32,699
Aku tahu siapa kau.

887
01:37:34,109 --> 01:37:36,236
Lucius Verus Aurelius.

888
01:37:49,457 --> 01:37:51,543
Acacius angkat tangan!

889
01:37:52,460 --> 01:37:54,796
Dia menyerah.

890
01:38:02,345 --> 01:38:04,431
Serahkan pada dewa.

891
01:38:21,907 --> 01:38:24,868
Keputusan dewa sudah dibuat.

892
01:38:27,913 --> 01:38:29,497
Lakukan yang perlu dilakukan.

893
01:38:30,498 --> 01:38:33,001
Tapi sebelum aku mati, ketahuilah...

894
01:38:34,753 --> 01:38:36,796
Aku mencintai ibumu, Lucilla.

895
01:38:38,173 --> 01:38:39,633
Dan ayahmu...

896
01:38:42,302 --> 01:38:43,428
Maximus.

897
01:38:44,638 --> 01:38:46,806
Aku akan mati demi dia.

898
01:38:46,890 --> 01:38:48,767
Bunuh dia!

899
01:38:48,850 --> 01:38:51,645
Ampuni dia!
Kumohon!

900
01:38:52,646 --> 01:38:55,815
Hidup! Hidup!

901
01:39:02,697 --> 01:39:04,491
Bunuh dia!

902
01:39:06,368 --> 01:39:07,327
Bunuh dia!

903
01:39:07,410 --> 01:39:08,662
Pemanah!

904
01:39:08,745 --> 01:39:10,580
- Tidak!
- Bunuh dia!

905
01:39:10,664 --> 01:39:13,208
Acacius!

906
01:39:13,291 --> 01:39:15,001
Bunuh dia!

907
01:39:15,085 --> 01:39:16,503
Bunuh dia!

908
01:39:16,586 --> 01:39:18,046
Bunuh dia!

909
01:39:20,215 --> 01:39:21,633
Acacius!

910
01:39:31,685 --> 01:39:32,769
Tidak!

911
01:39:33,311 --> 01:39:34,813
Tidak!

912
01:39:34,896 --> 01:39:36,606
Acacius!

913
01:39:38,267 --> 01:39:40,269
Sialan kau!

914
01:39:42,188 --> 01:39:44,148
Mati adalah hadiah yang terlalu baik bagimu!

915
01:39:49,612 --> 01:39:52,865
Begini cara Roma memperlakukan pahlawannya?

916
01:39:56,785 --> 01:39:58,370
Katakan!

917
01:40:00,372 --> 01:40:04,960
Jika hidupnya tidak berarti, lalu apa arti hidupmu?

918
01:40:05,044 --> 01:40:10,090
Para dewa sudah memutuskan!

919
01:40:24,021 --> 01:40:27,775
Hanno!

920
01:40:43,123 --> 01:40:46,252
Demi keselamatan, kita harus kembali ke istana.

921
01:40:54,510 --> 01:40:57,805
Hanno!

922
01:41:07,439 --> 01:41:09,900
Mundur!

923
01:41:58,032 --> 01:42:02,536
Arishat!

924
01:42:20,012 --> 01:42:21,638
Kita sudah sepakat.

925
01:42:25,184 --> 01:42:28,479
Kuserahkan dia padamu.
Malah tak habisi dia.

926
01:42:28,562 --> 01:42:30,230
Kau dapat yang kau mau.

927
01:42:30,314 --> 01:42:32,941
Aku selalu dapat apa yang kuinginkan.
Kenapa kau tak habisi dia?

928
01:42:33,025 --> 01:42:35,986
Kau beli gladiator, bukan budak.

929
01:42:37,613 --> 01:42:39,490
Aku bebas menentukan kehendakku.

930
01:42:41,617 --> 01:42:43,035


931
01:42:43,118 --> 01:42:45,788
Seberapa bangsawan dirimu?

932
01:42:45,871 --> 01:42:48,457
Mungkin ada keturunan Romawi...

933
01:42:48,540 --> 01:42:50,876
dalam dirimu.

934
01:42:56,465 --> 01:42:59,343
Kuil terbesar dalam sejarah Roma.

935
01:42:59,426 --> 01:43:00,969
Colosseum.

936
01:43:01,053 --> 01:43:03,389
Karena inilah yang mereka anut.

937
01:43:03,472 --> 01:43:05,099
Kekuatan.

938
01:43:05,182 --> 01:43:07,893
Di arena ini,
yang kuat berkuasa atas yang lemah.

939
01:43:07,976 --> 01:43:09,812
- Pasti ada yang lebih dari itu.
- Semua hanya ini.

940
01:43:09,895 --> 01:43:12,815
- Pasti ada Roma yang lain.
- Tak ada Roma lain.

941
01:43:14,233 --> 01:43:15,818
"Mimpi"?

942
01:43:15,901 --> 01:43:17,820
Mimpi Roma?

943
01:43:17,903 --> 01:43:19,530
Angan kosong orang tua.

944
01:43:21,240 --> 01:43:22,699
Siapa kau?

945
01:43:25,661 --> 01:43:28,789
Siapa nama aslimu
sebelum kau ganti nama Romawi?

946
01:43:29,748 --> 01:43:31,291
Kau tak bakalan tahu.

947
01:43:34,002 --> 01:43:35,712
Takdirku sudah ditulis.

948
01:43:39,091 --> 01:43:41,552
Para dewa mengutusmu kepadaku.

949
01:43:44,471 --> 01:43:46,181
Kau akan kuperintahkan.

950
01:43:46,265 --> 01:43:49,685
Aku takkan jadi pengikutmu,
di dunia ini maupun di kehidupan kelak.

951
01:43:57,860 --> 01:44:01,155
Itu bukan takdirku.

952
01:44:03,073 --> 01:44:04,741
Tapi aku akan melihat ajalmu.

953
01:44:25,762 --> 01:44:27,639
Apa lagi yang bisa kulakukan?

954
01:44:27,723 --> 01:44:29,516
Dia dan jalangnya mau membunuh kita.

955
01:44:29,600 --> 01:44:32,269
Kau tak dengar?
Mereka mengincar kepala kita!

956
01:44:32,352 --> 01:44:34,396
Praetorian akan membubarkan kerumunan ini.

957
01:44:34,480 --> 01:44:36,231
- Seperti yang biasa mereka lakukan.
- Ini semua gara-gara kau.

958
01:44:36,315 --> 01:44:38,859
Kera kotor!

959
01:44:42,404 --> 01:44:45,157
Mungkin sebaiknya kau,

960
01:44:45,240 --> 01:44:49,703
bawa Dondus ke tempat lain agar dia tenang?

961
01:44:59,171 --> 01:45:01,548
Maaf kemarahanku tadi saudaraku.

962
01:45:03,342 --> 01:45:04,885
Nafsu yang meracuni dirinya...

963
01:45:04,968 --> 01:45:06,929
sudah menghancurkan pikirannya.

964
01:45:07,012 --> 01:45:10,140
- Makin hari dia makin parah.
- Akan kucoba menasihatinya.

965
01:45:26,406 --> 01:45:29,535
Aku melihatmu.

966
01:45:29,618 --> 01:45:31,745
Aku melihatmu.

967
01:45:33,038 --> 01:45:35,249
Caracalla, Caracalla!

968
01:45:35,332 --> 01:45:36,959
Ayo, berdiri.

969
01:45:37,042 --> 01:45:39,127
Berdiri.
Bukan kau.

970
01:45:39,211 --> 01:45:41,088
Baiklah.

971
01:45:42,714 --> 01:45:45,050
Sekarang, dengar.

972
01:45:45,133 --> 01:45:46,718
Ada apa?

973
01:45:46,802 --> 01:45:49,471
Tak pernah ada yang jadi milikku.

974
01:45:49,555 --> 01:45:51,890
Semuanya selalu milik kita.

975
01:45:51,974 --> 01:45:55,269
Bahkan di dalam rahim, dia berusaha...

976
01:45:56,019 --> 01:45:59,356
memotong tali pusatku...

977
01:45:59,439 --> 01:46:01,275
agar aku tak bisa bernapas lagi.

978
01:46:01,358 --> 01:46:03,652
- Ingat, kan?
- Tentu.

979
01:46:03,735 --> 01:46:06,071
- Duduklah.
- Tak mungkin melupakan itu.

980
01:46:06,154 --> 01:46:08,407
Nuraniku mengharuskanku.

981
01:46:08,490 --> 01:46:09,950
Apa?

982
01:46:10,033 --> 01:46:11,243
Duduk.

983
01:46:11,326 --> 01:46:12,786
Kakakmu...

984
01:46:13,579 --> 01:46:15,163
mau menyalahkanmu...

985
01:46:16,081 --> 01:46:18,500
di hadapan Senat...

986
01:46:18,584 --> 01:46:19,960
Tapi itu bukan aku!

987
01:46:20,043 --> 01:46:21,628
...atas kerusuhan itu.

988
01:46:21,712 --> 01:46:24,089
- Kekacauan!
- Dia bohong!

989
01:46:24,172 --> 01:46:26,008
Tidak ada yang lebih menyakitkan...

990
01:46:26,091 --> 01:46:29,553
daripada seorang saudara bersaksi melawan saudaranya sendiri.

991
01:46:29,636 --> 01:46:32,306
Itu bohong!
Dia selalu bohong!

992
01:46:32,389 --> 01:46:34,850
Dia sangat lihai pengaruhi orang.

993
01:46:34,933 --> 01:46:37,644
Terus?
Mereka apakan aku?

994
01:46:37,728 --> 01:46:40,522
Oh, aku tak sanggup membayangkannya.
Tapi bayangkan ini:

995
01:46:40,606 --> 01:46:42,733
Mereka mau apakan Dondus?

996
01:46:45,777 --> 01:46:48,614
Mereka akan apakan...

997
01:46:48,697 --> 01:46:50,073
Dondus?

998
01:46:52,451 --> 01:46:53,827
Itu keputusanmu.

999
01:47:31,573 --> 01:47:32,532
Kakak.

1000
01:47:36,078 --> 01:47:37,871
Jatuhkan pisaunya.

1001
01:47:37,954 --> 01:47:39,081
Kau bohong.

1002
01:47:39,164 --> 01:47:40,957
- Berikan.
- Kau suka bohong!

1003
01:47:41,041 --> 01:47:42,000
Berikan...

1004
01:47:45,921 --> 01:47:48,173
Lihat aku.

1005
01:47:48,256 --> 01:47:50,676
- Bohong!
- Dengar. Lepaskan dirimu dari kutukan itu.

1006
01:47:50,759 --> 01:47:52,761
- Bohong!
- Lepaskan dirimu dari kutukan itu.

1007
01:47:52,844 --> 01:47:56,098
Aku selalu melindungimu.
Karena aku sayang.

1008
01:47:56,682 --> 01:47:58,809
Sadarlah. Bantu aku.

1009
01:48:16,973 --> 01:48:18,433
Lucius.

1010
01:48:40,079 --> 01:48:42,707
Tak kusangka takdir membawa kita ke sini.

1011
01:48:44,834 --> 01:48:46,711
Tapi, di sinilah kita.

1012
01:48:48,296 --> 01:48:50,048
Takdir membawa kita ke tempat asal.

1013
01:48:50,131 --> 01:48:53,217
Kau jauhkan aku, namun takdir...

1014
01:48:53,301 --> 01:48:55,887
mengembalikanku ke tempat kematiannya.

1015
01:48:58,806 --> 01:48:59,891
Ini...

1016
01:49:01,684 --> 01:49:03,478
cincin ayahku.

1017
01:49:07,440 --> 01:49:10,526
Dia berikan pada ayahmu, Maximus,

1018
01:49:10,610 --> 01:49:12,570
sebagai tanda kepercayaan.

1019
01:49:13,863 --> 01:49:16,949
Kuberikan sama Acacius karena keberaniannya.

1020
01:49:21,371 --> 01:49:23,664
Ini cincin istriku.

1021
01:49:26,542 --> 01:49:28,127
Akan kupakai di sebelah cincinmu.

1022
01:49:42,308 --> 01:49:44,852
Aku turut berduka atas Acacius.

1023
01:49:46,062 --> 01:49:48,856
Aku tak bisa melihatnya lagi.

1024
01:49:51,067 --> 01:49:53,027
Dia seorang prajurit Roma.

1025
01:49:54,904 --> 01:49:56,364
Ada rencana.

1026
01:49:57,573 --> 01:49:58,950
Dia tengah mempersiapkan pasukan di Ostia...

1027
01:49:59,033 --> 01:50:02,078
di bawah perintah Darius Sextus.

1028
01:50:02,161 --> 01:50:05,289
Pasukan yang akan melawan para kaisar.

1029
01:50:07,250 --> 01:50:11,712
Acacius, Maximus, Marcus Aurelius.

1030
01:50:12,755 --> 01:50:15,216
Mereka hidup dan mati demi Roma.

1031
01:50:15,842 --> 01:50:17,385
Kita pun juga.

1032
01:50:19,345 --> 01:50:21,806
Benar mereka mau membunuhmu?

1033
01:50:24,684 --> 01:50:26,727
Sejak ayahku mati, selalu saja...

1034
01:50:26,811 --> 01:50:29,230
ada pedang mengincar leherku.

1035
01:50:32,358 --> 01:50:34,444
Sekarang aku menemukanmu,

1036
01:50:35,194 --> 01:50:37,071
itu tak masalah lagi.

1037
01:50:38,364 --> 01:50:40,116
Aku tak takut.

1038
01:50:40,199 --> 01:50:43,369
Aku sudah terbiasa kehilangan orang yang kucintai.

1039
01:50:46,122 --> 01:50:47,373
Setelah menemukannmu,

1040
01:50:47,457 --> 01:50:49,250
aku tak mau lagi kehilanganmu.

1041
01:50:52,336 --> 01:50:54,630
Kau berdiri seperti dia.

1042
01:50:55,298 --> 01:50:56,757
Tegap.

1043
01:50:57,550 --> 01:50:58,759
Bangga.

1044
01:51:00,887 --> 01:51:03,556
Aku tidak sekuat dia.

1045
01:51:04,390 --> 01:51:06,601
Andai itu benar.

1046
01:51:07,894 --> 01:51:11,063
Andai aku bisa menyuruhmu pergi dari sini.

1047
01:51:19,822 --> 01:51:21,032
Pergi sekarang.

1048
01:51:29,248 --> 01:51:30,500
Kekuatan dan kehormatan.

1049
01:51:32,919 --> 01:51:34,670
Kekuatan dan kehormatan.

1050
01:51:47,225 --> 01:51:49,352
Sebagai Kaisar,

1051
01:51:49,435 --> 01:51:51,145
aku memanggil...

1052
01:51:52,021 --> 01:51:55,274
Senat untuk menunjuk Konsul Pertama...

1053
01:51:55,358 --> 01:51:58,694
yang akan mengurus urusan militer...

1054
01:51:58,778 --> 01:52:02,114
dan sipil Kekaisaran.

1055
01:52:05,868 --> 01:52:07,328
Aku angkat...

1056
01:52:08,371 --> 01:52:10,831
Dondus jadi Warga Negara!

1057
01:52:17,797 --> 01:52:19,549
Hidup Dondus!

1058
01:52:22,885 --> 01:52:24,470
Hidup Dondus!

1059
01:52:26,389 --> 01:52:29,100
- Hidup Dondus.
- Hidup Dondus!

1060
01:52:29,183 --> 01:52:31,769
Hidup Dondus!

1061
01:52:35,898 --> 01:52:37,858
Sebagai Konsul Kedua,

1062
01:52:39,694 --> 01:52:41,279
aku tunjuk...

1063
01:52:43,573 --> 01:52:44,949
Warga Negara...

1064
01:52:47,159 --> 01:52:48,661
Macrinus!

1065
01:52:50,955 --> 01:52:52,665
Hidup Macrinus!

1066
01:52:52,748 --> 01:52:54,250
Hidup Macrinus!

1067
01:52:54,333 --> 01:52:56,335
Hidup Macrinus!

1068
01:52:58,087 --> 01:53:00,673
Akan diadakan parade kemenangan.

1069
01:53:00,756 --> 01:53:02,383
Akan ada pertunjukan...

1070
01:53:03,050 --> 01:53:05,052
dan pembantaian massal.

1071
01:53:08,180 --> 01:53:10,975
Hidup Kaisar!

1072
01:53:12,435 --> 01:53:14,228
Hidup Kaisar!

1073
01:53:14,312 --> 01:53:16,063
Hidup Kaisar!

1074
01:53:22,361 --> 01:53:23,654
Duduk.

1075
01:53:26,949 --> 01:53:29,744
Dengan sedikit...

1076
01:53:33,205 --> 01:53:37,001
keberuntungan dan keahlianku...

1077
01:53:38,628 --> 01:53:41,881
aku kini didengar oleh kaisar yang tersisa.

1078
01:53:48,971 --> 01:53:51,349
Aku bisa jelaskan dengan rasional...

1079
01:53:56,020 --> 01:53:58,606
dan meredakan kekacauan di jalanan. Tapi...

1080
01:54:01,484 --> 01:54:03,194
untuk membawa ketenangan,

1081
01:54:05,154 --> 01:54:07,114
aku butuh kuasa...

1082
01:54:10,743 --> 01:54:12,870
dan kendali...

1083
01:54:13,496 --> 01:54:15,539
atas Pasukan Praetoria.

1084
01:54:21,337 --> 01:54:23,172
Suara...

1085
01:54:25,257 --> 01:54:26,717
atau angkat tangan?

1086
01:54:28,761 --> 01:54:31,389
- Ya!
- Ya!

1087
01:54:34,600 --> 01:54:36,310
Hamba setiamu.

1088
01:54:40,356 --> 01:54:41,982
Turunkan tanganmu.

1089
01:54:44,568 --> 01:54:46,153
Duduklah.

1090
01:54:59,025 --> 01:55:00,735
Roma harus tumbang.

1091
01:55:03,363 --> 01:55:05,490
Cukup beri sedikit dorongan.

1092
01:55:08,451 --> 01:55:10,745
Setelah Roma jatuh,

1093
01:55:11,579 --> 01:55:14,082
apa selanjutnya?

1094
01:55:16,126 --> 01:55:18,253
Kau anak dari ayahmu.

1095
01:55:20,130 --> 01:55:23,633
Mimpi Roma-nya hanyalah angan-angan.

1096
01:55:23,716 --> 01:55:25,760
Cuma khayalan.

1097
01:55:25,844 --> 01:55:28,138
"Balas dendam terbaik adalah...

1098
01:55:28,221 --> 01:55:32,100
tidak menjadi seperti orang yang menyakitimu."

1099
01:55:32,183 --> 01:55:37,188
Aku tak lagi seperti ayahmu.

1100
01:55:37,272 --> 01:55:40,817
Dia berbicara tentang impian,
aku tentang realitas.

1101
01:55:40,900 --> 01:55:43,444
Di Roma kebenaran...

1102
01:55:44,904 --> 01:55:47,031
hanya milik yang terkuat.

1103
01:55:49,242 --> 01:55:50,702
Dulu aku berada...

1104
01:55:52,078 --> 01:55:53,705
di bawah perintah kaisar.

1105
01:55:56,583 --> 01:55:58,793
Sekarang aku yang memerintah kekaisaran.

1106
01:55:59,752 --> 01:56:03,131
Selain di Roma,
siapa lagi yang bisa meraih itu?

1107
01:56:08,303 --> 01:56:12,932
Kau lihat tanda ayahmu di tubuhku?

1108
01:56:17,645 --> 01:56:19,063
Jika ada yang...

1109
01:56:19,689 --> 01:56:21,149
kau butuhkan...

1110
01:56:22,775 --> 01:56:24,569
di sisa waktu ini,

1111
01:56:25,445 --> 01:56:27,238
akan kami sediakan.

1112
01:56:32,827 --> 01:56:35,663
Kematianmu akan memuluskan jalanku ke tahta.

1113
01:56:37,457 --> 01:56:40,460
Besok akan ada pertunjukan.

1114
01:56:40,543 --> 01:56:42,253
Di arena itu,

1115
01:56:43,046 --> 01:56:44,839
aku akan menang.

1116
01:56:58,394 --> 01:56:59,979
Ravi!

1117
01:57:06,444 --> 01:57:08,738
Bisa kirimkan pesan ke Ostia besok pagi?

1118
01:57:08,821 --> 01:57:10,573
Ada apa di Ostia?

1119
01:57:10,657 --> 01:57:12,200
Ada pasukan.

1120
01:57:14,327 --> 01:57:16,037
Beranilah mengambil risiko, temanku,

1121
01:57:16,120 --> 01:57:18,373
demi sesuatu yang lebih besar.

1122
01:57:21,167 --> 01:57:22,669
Pergi ke Ostia.

1123
01:57:23,836 --> 01:57:25,964
Berikan cincin ini pada Jenderal Darius Sextus.

1124
01:57:26,047 --> 01:57:27,548
Mengerti?

1125
01:57:28,091 --> 01:57:30,760
Darius Sextus.

1126
01:57:30,843 --> 01:57:32,971
Dia akan tahu ini cincin Acacius.

1127
01:57:35,807 --> 01:57:38,059
Dan,

1128
01:57:38,851 --> 01:57:40,611
aku harus bilang siapa...

1129
01:57:40,895 --> 01:57:42,689
yang mengirimkan cincin ini?

1130
01:57:45,942 --> 01:57:48,403
Aku Lucius Verus Aurelius.

1131
01:57:49,529 --> 01:57:51,155
Pangeran Roma.

1132
01:57:52,282 --> 01:57:56,283
Sampaikan kalau aku mengerahkan
pasukan untuk Republik baru.

1133
01:58:04,794 --> 01:58:06,045
- Aku bisa mempercayaimu?
- Ya.

1134
01:58:06,129 --> 01:58:08,298
- Bisa?
- Ya.

1135
01:58:15,096 --> 01:58:17,890
Ravi! Aku perlu kuncimu.

1136
01:58:23,896 --> 01:58:25,690
Terima kasih.

1137
01:59:03,436 --> 01:59:05,980
Berhenti!  Kembali!

1138
01:59:36,636 --> 01:59:37,887
Siapa yang berikan ini?

1139
01:59:38,763 --> 01:59:41,015
Lucius versus Aurelius.

1140
01:59:42,141 --> 01:59:43,476
Pangeran Roma.

1141
02:00:36,529 --> 02:00:39,699
Kita harus bunuh Lucilla?

1142
02:00:41,200 --> 02:00:45,079
Selama dia hidup,
kedamaian tidak akan kau nikmati.

1143
02:00:46,873 --> 02:00:47,999
Selamanya.

1144
02:00:58,759 --> 02:01:01,387
Rakyat mencintainya.
Kematian Lucilla akan memicu kerusuhan.

1145
02:01:01,471 --> 02:01:04,056
Jika dia mati dan rakyat marah,

1146
02:01:04,140 --> 02:01:05,641
akan kuserahkan kepala Caracalla...

1147
02:01:05,725 --> 02:01:07,143
dan rakyat akan memujiku.

1148
02:01:07,226 --> 02:01:10,938
Begitulah politik, temanku.

1149
02:01:13,649 --> 02:01:15,610
- Siap?
- Ya.

1150
02:01:30,750 --> 02:01:32,960
Hari ini pertarungan terakhirmu, sang juara.

1151
02:01:33,961 --> 02:01:35,713
Tuan kami memberi padamu...

1152
02:01:37,965 --> 02:01:40,468
pedang kayu kebebasan.

1153
02:01:44,347 --> 02:01:46,390
Tapi kau harus menangkan dulu.

1154
02:01:46,474 --> 02:01:48,935
Hari ini, kau akan membela ibumu.

1155
02:02:11,749 --> 02:02:14,710
Kayu atau baja, hasilnya tetap sama!

1156
02:02:41,862 --> 02:02:43,489
Tunggu aku.

1157
02:03:02,216 --> 02:03:03,968
Untuk menghormati...

1158
02:03:04,051 --> 02:03:08,389
pengakuan Kaisar Caracalla,

1159
02:03:08,472 --> 02:03:14,437
Konsul Pertama Dondus, dan Konsul Kedua Macrinus,

1160
02:03:14,520 --> 02:03:19,066
serta sebagai hukuman atas konspirasinya
terhadap kekaisaran,

1161
02:03:19,150 --> 02:03:23,654
dan fitnah terhadap keturunan kekaisaran,

1162
02:03:23,738 --> 02:03:25,990
dan penghasutan pemberontakan militer...

1163
02:03:26,073 --> 02:03:27,575
bersama suaminya,

1164
02:03:27,658 --> 02:03:31,329
ratu akan dibawa ke pengadilan ilahi...

1165
02:03:31,412 --> 02:03:35,625
oleh Pengawal Praetoria.

1166
02:03:59,382 --> 02:04:01,009
Aku bukan seorang jenderal.

1167
02:04:02,594 --> 02:04:06,222
Tapi kita semua prajurit.

1168
02:04:08,099 --> 02:04:09,893
Sejauh ini,

1169
02:04:09,976 --> 02:04:14,272
kita hanya berjuang bertahan hidup dari hari ke hari.

1170
02:04:14,355 --> 02:04:16,316
Apa perintahmu?

1171
02:04:17,525 --> 02:04:18,777
Kembalilah ke selmu...

1172
02:04:18,860 --> 02:04:20,904
jika tak mau ikut perang.

1173
02:04:20,987 --> 02:04:23,406
Atau...

1174
02:04:25,033 --> 02:04:26,493
kau ikut aku.

1175
02:04:27,660 --> 02:04:30,080
Berjuang demi kebebasan yang tak terhalang tembok ini.

1176
02:04:30,163 --> 02:04:31,748
Ya!

1177
02:04:31,831 --> 02:04:36,127
Dulunya kehormatan begitu dihormati di Roma.

1178
02:04:37,712 --> 02:04:39,339
Di Roma ini,

1179
02:04:40,131 --> 02:04:42,300
aku tak lagi menemukan itu.

1180
02:04:42,383 --> 02:04:44,385
Kita harus menemukannya!

1181
02:04:46,638 --> 02:04:48,431
Dan ketahuilah:

1182
02:04:49,641 --> 02:04:53,520
Dimana ada kematian, kita tidak ada di situ.

1183
02:04:55,396 --> 02:04:57,440
Dimana ada kematian,

1184
02:04:58,066 --> 02:04:59,901
kita tidak ada!

1185
02:05:02,821 --> 02:05:04,197
Dengan pedangku.

1186
02:05:05,990 --> 02:05:07,742
Kekuatan dan martabat.

1187
02:05:07,826 --> 02:05:09,786
Kekuatan dan martabat!

1188
02:05:09,869 --> 02:05:11,538
Kekuatan dan martabat!

1189
02:05:11,621 --> 02:05:13,581
Kekuatan dan martabat!

1190
02:05:38,189 --> 02:05:40,316
Jangan sampai ada yang bilang...

1191
02:05:40,400 --> 02:05:43,528
kaisar tak punya belas kasihan.

1192
02:05:43,611 --> 02:05:49,117
Ratu akan diberikan satu gladiator...

1193
02:05:49,200 --> 02:05:52,996
untuk melawan Pengawal Praetoria.

1194
02:06:02,964 --> 02:06:06,968
Sang juara, Hanno!

1195
02:06:10,805 --> 02:06:14,434
Hanno!

1196
02:07:19,958 --> 02:07:21,793
Ya!

1197
02:07:25,880 --> 02:07:27,840
Perintahkan pasukan berkuda.
Tumpas ini segera.

1198
02:07:29,259 --> 02:07:31,761
Ini perang! Perang sebenarnya!

1199
02:07:36,599 --> 02:07:40,103
Pasukan Acacius sedang bergerak menuju Roma, tuan.

1200
02:07:42,647 --> 02:07:44,107
Kita bisa kepung mereka.

1201
02:07:44,190 --> 02:07:46,651
Pasukan mereka tak lebih dari 5.000.

1202
02:07:47,902 --> 02:07:49,404
Kita berapa?

1203
02:07:49,487 --> 02:07:50,863
Enam ribu. Mungkin lebih.

1204
02:07:50,947 --> 02:07:52,615
Ke gerbang dan tahan pasukan itu.

1205
02:08:44,375 --> 02:08:45,543
Berandal brengsek!

1206
02:08:59,307 --> 02:09:00,933
Lucius!

1207
02:09:02,602 --> 02:09:03,770
Berikan busurnya.

1208
02:09:27,460 --> 02:09:30,004
Pergi, anakku. Lucius...

1209
02:09:30,088 --> 02:09:31,214


1210
02:09:31,297 --> 02:09:32,757
Kuda!

1211
02:11:05,475 --> 02:11:07,602
Apa tak ada yang bisa bunuh barbar ini?

1212
02:11:07,685 --> 02:11:10,229
Namaku Lucius Verus Aurelius!

1213
02:11:10,313 --> 02:11:12,690
Untuk jadi kaisar, keturunan saja tak cukup.

1214
02:11:12,773 --> 02:11:15,526
Harus direbut dan dipertahankan dengan kekuatan.

1215
02:11:15,610 --> 02:11:17,445
Apa kau seperti itu?

1216
02:11:17,528 --> 02:11:18,988
Aku tak bertempur demi kekuasaan.

1217
02:11:19,071 --> 02:11:21,824
Aku berjuang membebaskan Roma dari orang sepertimu...

1218
02:11:21,908 --> 02:11:23,409
dan mengembalikannya ke rakyat.

1219
02:11:23,493 --> 02:11:26,329
Para dewa menghendaki kebangkitan Roma.

1220
02:11:26,412 --> 02:11:29,373
Aku ditugaskan menyelesaikan misi itu.

1221
02:11:29,457 --> 02:11:33,044
Dan kalau para dewa mengutusku untuk membunuhmu?

1222
02:11:33,127 --> 02:11:34,253


1223
02:11:35,296 --> 02:11:37,590
Saatnya mengakhiri ini, Macrinus!

1224
02:12:13,584 --> 02:12:15,920


1225
02:12:45,700 --> 02:12:47,285
Kekuatan dan kehormatan,

1226
02:12:47,785 --> 02:12:49,412
anakku.

1227
02:14:21,672 --> 02:14:23,507
Kalian menantiku untuk bicara.

1228
02:14:25,592 --> 02:14:27,302
Entah aku harus bilang apa selain...

1229
02:14:27,386 --> 02:14:29,513
kita sudah terlalu sering melihat kematian.

1230
02:14:30,639 --> 02:14:34,267
Jangan ada lagi korban atas nama tirani.

1231
02:14:38,105 --> 02:14:40,649
Kakekku, Marcus Aurelius,

1232
02:14:40,732 --> 02:14:43,694
menceritakan sebuah mimpi tentang Roma.

1233
02:14:44,611 --> 02:14:46,613
Sebuah mimpi yang ayahku,

1234
02:14:47,739 --> 02:14:50,575
Maximus Decimus Meridius,

1235
02:14:50,659 --> 02:14:52,285
rela mati demi itu.

1236
02:14:53,412 --> 02:14:55,122
Sebuah impian.

1237
02:14:57,749 --> 02:15:02,129
Kota bagi banyak orang,
tempat berlindung bagi yang butuh.

1238
02:15:02,212 --> 02:15:04,798
Rumah yang patut diperjuangkan.

1239
02:15:05,799 --> 02:15:10,220
Rumah yang Maximus lindungi sepanjang hayatnya.

1240
02:15:12,180 --> 02:15:14,141
Mimpi itu sudah sirna.

1241
02:15:19,980 --> 02:15:21,732
Tapi apa kita berani...

1242
02:15:23,150 --> 02:15:25,902
membangun kembali mimpi itu bersama?

1243
02:15:37,706 --> 02:15:39,583
Bagaimana?

1244
02:15:45,839 --> 02:15:47,799
Ya!

1245
02:15:48,842 --> 02:15:50,260
Ya!

1246
02:15:50,886 --> 02:15:52,137
Ya!

1247
02:15:52,220 --> 02:15:56,683
Ya!  Ya!

1248
02:17:01,289 --> 02:17:02,582
Ibu.

1249
02:17:55,051 --> 02:17:57,345
Bicaralah, Ayah.